Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.29,0:04:20.68,注释,,0000,0000,0000,,(哥斯达黎加 胡安 圣塔马利亚机场)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.52,0:05:06.38,注释,,0000,0000,0000,,(扎克和格雷 米切尔)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.28,0:09:00.45,注释,,0000,0000,0000,,(哈蒙德创意实验室)
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.19,0:34:43.74,注释,,0000,0000,0000,,(未监测到热能信号)
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.99,1:42:52.33,注释,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.36,0:01:15.70,注释,,0000,0000,0000,,《侏罗纪世界》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.63,0:05:45.34,注释,,0000,0000,0000,,(侏罗纪世界)
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.32,0:34:36.36,注释,,0000,0000,0000,,(未监测到热能信号)
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.79,1:14:24.03,注释,,0000,0000,0000,,(侏罗纪公园)
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.34,1:18:06.22,注释,,0000,0000,0000,,(危险 万伏高压)
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.51,1:41:47.14,注释,,0000,0000,0000,,(哈蒙德创意实验室)
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.15,0:02:09.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,孩子们 出发了
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.60,0:02:16.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,格雷
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.97,0:02:19.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的 你在做什么
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.20,0:02:21.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么 我们该走了
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.00,0:02:23.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 亲爱的 你的航班还有两小时就要起飞了
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.35,0:02:26.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,从这到戴恩机场要36分钟 堵车的话要一小时
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.64,0:02:29.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把你的屁股挪进车里要多久
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.12,0:02:32.92,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,要多久呢
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.92,0:02:35.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 给你床下的小怪兽喂食了吗 - 是的
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.12,0:02:40.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,每天给我打电话
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.01,0:02:42.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,给我发照片 这样我就不会忘记你这张帅脸
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.87,0:02:44.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我只去一个星期
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.64,0:02:45.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,扎克
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.78,0:02:49.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们又不是生离死别 拜托
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.48,0:02:50.59,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快点
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.59,0:02:53.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 回见 - 我爱你
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.62,0:02:56.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 再见 好吗 - 再见
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.61,0:02:58.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你上车了吗
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.21,0:03:04.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道分离很心痛 亲爱的
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.15,0:03:06.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.22,0:03:12.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么问题吧
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.83,0:03:14.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我真羡慕
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.75,0:03:17.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们会玩得非常开心的 我爱你
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.96,0:03:19.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我也爱你
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.30,0:03:27.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 很好
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.89,0:03:31.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我把这些交给你哥哥 可以吗
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.30,0:03:33.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你拿好这些 你能拿着这些吗
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.87,0:03:36.28,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 亲爱的 我要你保管好这些 - 好的
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.28,0:03:37.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.03,0:03:39.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好了 - 好好听你妈妈说话
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.00,0:03:40.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,照顾好你弟弟 记得接电话
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.90,0:03:43.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我很认真的 就是那个绿色的按键
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.20,0:03:45.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,当你看到我的名字 就按下它 明白吗
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.57,0:03:49.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,还有记住 有东西追你的话 跑
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.69,0:03:51.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.25,0:03:53.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好吧 - 你真幽默 好了 我们出发吧
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.91,0:03:54.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 再见 孩子们 - 再见
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.91,0:03:57.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我已经开始想你们了 - 好吧
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.95,0:04:01.61,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,真像是我们家的最后一次早餐
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.54,0:04:05.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要说这种话
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.34,0:04:08.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你给你妹妹打电话了吗
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.09,0:04:10.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,转到语音信箱了
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.58,0:04:12.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没事的
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.37,0:04:14.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她一天要接待两万位游客呢
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.45,0:04:16.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,多两个不是问题
Dialogue: 1,0:04:20.68,0:04:22.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这个岛有多大
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.29,0:04:23.92,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,很大
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.92,0:04:25.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,有多重
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.86,0:04:27.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你这个问题问得有问题
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.77,0:04:33.59,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们最初开放的时候 只有八个种类
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.59,0:04:36.41,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,现在他们有14种食草恐龙和6种食肉恐龙
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.41,0:04:38.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一周要吃掉50吨的食物
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.70,0:05:01.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到努布拉岛 侏罗纪世界之家
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.82,0:05:04.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,希望您能在此有一段安全而愉快的探险之旅
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.39,0:05:08.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱尔阿姨在哪儿
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.39,0:05:33.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,坐在列车前排的游客
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.05,0:05:35.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,可以看到我们的大门
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.30,0:05:50.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,请遵守所有园区规则
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.45,0:05:52.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,请着装得体 包括鞋子和衬衫
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.67,0:05:54.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,也必须时刻穿戴整齐
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.05,0:05:57.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们的阿姨安排一点钟见你们 他能慢点走吗
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.81,0:05:59.41,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不能
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.41,0:06:01.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快来
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.00,0:06:08.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你阿姨给你们开通了贵宾通道
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.75,0:06:11.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们可以不用排队一路畅玩
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.31,0:06:12.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快去玩吧
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.57,0:06:13.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,老弟 她说我们要等一会儿
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.79,0:06:15.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想再等了
Dialogue: 1,0:06:44.67,0:06:48.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哈尔·奥斯特利是副总裁 吉姆·德鲁克是谢顶
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.31,0:06:50.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,埃里卡·布兰德 时运不济
Dialogue: 1,0:06:50.61,0:06:53.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哈尔 吉姆 埃里卡 哈尔 吉姆 埃里卡
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.52,0:06:55.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是克莱尔
Dialogue: 1,0:06:56.21,0:06:58.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,迟到了三分钟
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.15,0:07:03.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到侏罗纪世界
Dialogue: 1,0:07:04.94,0:07:07.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,年复一年 收入保持增长
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.55,0:07:09.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,同时运营成本也比过去高出许多
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.81,0:07:13.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我们的投资者一直很有耐心 但是坦白说
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.39,0:07:16.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没有人再对恐龙感到新奇
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.70,0:07:19.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,20年前 复活灭绝物种就像魔法
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.80,0:07:21.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,而现在 孩子们看见一只
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.40,0:07:24.28,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,剑龙就像在城市动物园看见大象一样
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.29,0:07:27.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这并不意味资产发展已经落后了
Dialogue: 1,0:07:27.09,0:07:30.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的基因发掘家每年都会探索出新的物种
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.87,0:07:36.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但是消费者想看体型更大 叫声更响 牙齿更多的动物
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.00,0:07:37.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好消息是
Dialogue: 1,0:07:37.61,0:07:38.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在基因融合领域的
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.73,0:07:41.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,改进已经开辟了一个新的前沿
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.07,0:07:44.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,相比挖骨头的那个世纪 过去十年我们
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.96,0:07:47.93,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,从遗传学中学到了更多
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.93,0:07:48.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,所以
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.90,0:07:52.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,当你想吸引赞助商
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.87,0:07:54.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你脑中想起的是什么
Dialogue: 1,0:07:56.00,0:07:57.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们想要兴奋刺激的感觉
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.55,0:07:59.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,谁不是呢
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.80,0:08:07.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,暴虐霸王龙 我们的第一个转基因混血恐龙
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.80,0:08:10.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们怎么让两种不同的恐龙内啥 你懂的
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.93,0:08:15.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 暴虐霸王龙不是繁殖出来的 她是设计出来的
Dialogue: 1,0:08:15.80,0:08:19.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,成熟后她将有50英尺长
Dialogue: 1,0:08:19.83,0:08:21.34,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,比霸王龙体型还要大
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.34,0:08:25.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,每次我们推出一个新的资产的时候 入场率都会飙升
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.83,0:08:27.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,全球新闻头条
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.47,0:08:29.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,各界名流参观
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.27,0:08:31.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,世界瞩目
Dialogue: 1,0:08:31.10,0:08:32.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她什么时候能准备好
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.53,0:08:36.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她已经准备好了
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.21,0:08:51.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快来
Dialogue: 1,0:08:51.52,0:08:52.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,别激动
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.76,0:08:54.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快啊
Dialogue: 1,0:08:54.42,0:08:55.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,老弟 冷静点
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.45,0:09:02.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到创新中心
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.70,0:09:05.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在这里科技见证史前时代
Dialogue: 1,0:09:13.13,0:09:16.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,可以与顶端食肉动物角牙搏斗
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.45,0:09:20.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,希腊语的字面意思是三角面
Dialogue: 1,0:09:20.05,0:09:22.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,三角恐龙只有T霸王龙的一半高
Dialogue: 1,0:09:22.99,0:09:26.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,它的威力有如一百万亿吨的炸药
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.03,0:09:30.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,转头看向背后
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.46,0:09:34.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,来更好地甩动它那危险的尾巴瞄准敌人
Dialogue: 1,0:09:37.86,0:09:40.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,氧氨嘧啶 鸟嘌呤 腺嘌呤和胸腺嘧啶（核酸主要成分）
Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.19,0:09:41.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一切生物都有的四种物质
Dialogue: 1,0:09:41.84,0:09:43.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 别到处乱跑 好吗
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.54,0:09:45.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈不会为我照顾孩子付钱的
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.77,0:09:48.92,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,格雷 是你吗
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.92,0:09:50.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱尔阿姨
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.38,0:09:52.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 是的 不 我要挂电话了 我的侄子们来了
Dialogue: 1,0:09:53.74,0:09:54.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.74,0:09:59.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 我的天哪 你真可爱
Dialogue: 1,0:09:59.81,0:10:01.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,喔 扎克
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.65,0:10:04.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我上次见你的时候 你只有
Dialogue: 1,0:10:04.22,0:10:05.61,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,多少年前来着
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.61,0:10:08.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 三四年前 - 七年前
Dialogue: 1,0:10:08.22,0:10:10.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,七年前 但是 已经很接近了
Dialogue: 1,0:10:11.61,0:10:14.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我看到你们已经拿到腕带了
Dialogue: 1,0:10:14.49,0:10:16.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是用来买食物的
Dialogue: 1,0:10:16.17,0:10:19.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是扎拉 她会照顾好你们的
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.00,0:10:20.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,直到我今晚忙完工作 好吗
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.96,0:10:22.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你不和我们一起去吗
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.95,0:10:26.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我真希望我可以 但是
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.06,0:10:29.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,明天我可以带你们去主控室
Dialogue: 1,0:10:29.83,0:10:31.92,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,让你们看看幕后的一切
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.92,0:10:34.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那一定很酷 不是吗
Dialogue: 1,0:10:35.98,0:10:41.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 我今晚六点来找你们
Dialogue: 1,0:10:41.10,0:10:42.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 不 别忘了你还有个
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.64,0:10:44.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 当然 我今晚八点见你们
Dialogue: 1,0:10:44.75,0:10:46.68,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们几点睡觉
Dialogue: 1,0:10:46.68,0:10:49.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,还是你们睡觉时间不同
Dialogue: 1,0:10:51.38,0:10:54.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 玩得开心
Dialogue: 1,0:10:54.11,0:10:56.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,照顾好他们 好吗
Dialogue: 1,0:10:58.17,0:10:59.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 不 我在
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.68,0:11:07.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是两只幼年三角龙 他们又朝它过去了
Dialogue: 1,0:11:07.02,0:11:09.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是麻醉它们 还是你来对付它们
Dialogue: 1,0:11:09.91,0:11:12.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 麻醉它们吧 - 他们跑了
Dialogue: 1,0:11:12.84,0:11:15.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 今日游园人数是多少 - 22216人
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.89,0:11:17.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 有什么事故发生吗 - 是的
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.33,0:11:19.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,有六个孩子走失
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.08,0:11:21.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,28名游客中暑
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.51,0:11:23.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你从哪儿买来的那东西
Dialogue: 1,0:11:23.57,0:11:27.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 这个 我在易趣上买的 它真的很神奇
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.54,0:11:31.26,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我花150美元买的 不过全新的要300美元
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.26,0:11:32.92,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你不觉得它很没品位吗
Dialogue: 1,0:11:32.92,0:11:34.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这T恤 不 不会
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.78,0:11:36.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道有人伤亡 那件事可怕
Dialogue: 1,0:11:36.71,0:11:40.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但第一个公园是合法的
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.15,0:11:41.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我超级尊敬它
Dialogue: 1,0:11:41.42,0:11:43.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们根本不需要这些遗传混血恐龙
Dialogue: 1,0:11:43.02,0:11:45.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们只需要恐龙 真正的恐龙
Dialogue: 1,0:11:45.08,0:11:46.93,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 拜托别再穿它了
Dialogue: 1,0:11:46.93,0:11:48.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 我不会了
Dialogue: 1,0:11:48.10,0:11:50.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你谈成了吗 - 应该没问题
Dialogue: 1,0:11:50.46,0:11:54.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,威瑞森无线公司出品的暴虐霸王龙
Dialogue: 1,0:11:54.19,0:11:56.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,真是太可怕了
Dialogue: 1,0:11:56.75,0:11:58.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛不更过分点
Dialogue: 1,0:11:58.39,0:12:01.28,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,直接让这些公司给恐龙命名算了
Dialogue: 1,0:12:01.28,0:12:02.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,反正他们已经命名了所有棒球场
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.76,0:12:05.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 何必止步于此呢 - 为什么西部平原关闭了
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.36,0:12:07.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,又有一头肿头龙在区域外游荡
Dialogue: 1,0:12:07.13,0:12:08.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但他已经被麻醉了 准备送回去
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.98,0:12:11.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不如叫百事恐龙或者托斯蒂多滋恐龙（玉米片品牌）
Dialogue: 1,0:12:11.36,0:12:13.28,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,安保说隐形围栏是不会出问题的
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.29,0:12:15.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是这个月第二次发生这种事了
Dialogue: 1,0:12:15.35,0:12:18.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,肿头龙打架的时候把他们的植入物弄短路了
Dialogue: 1,0:12:18.46,0:12:20.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,还要多久能把它弄走
Dialogue: 1,0:12:20.47,0:12:23.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他刚被注射5毫克的镇静剂
Dialogue: 1,0:12:23.22,0:12:27.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 他已经被麻醉了 我们为什么不能对他略表同情呢
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.51,0:12:30.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说 你知道他们是有血有肉的动物 对吗
Dialogue: 1,0:12:31.31,0:12:32.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把你的工作区清理下
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.69,0:12:35.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,乱死了
Dialogue: 1,0:12:35.22,0:12:38.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢把它看作是一个生态系统
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.73,0:12:40.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,只要有足够的稳定性
Dialogue: 1,0:12:40.37,0:12:43.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就能防止它陷入混乱
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.93,0:12:53.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,直升飞机已入境 侏罗纪一号 五分钟后抵达
Dialogue: 1,0:13:17.06,0:13:18.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱尔
Dialogue: 1,0:13:18.64,0:13:22.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,马斯拉尼先生 是你在驾驶啊
Dialogue: 1,0:13:22.06,0:13:23.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我拿到执照了
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.67,0:13:26.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 两天后 - 好吧 还差两天
Dialogue: 1,0:13:26.05,0:13:27.23,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好的 - 那么
Dialogue: 1,0:13:27.23,0:13:29.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我的公园怎么样 - 很好
Dialogue: 1,0:13:29.39,0:13:31.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,去年我们盈利又提升了2.5个百分点
Dialogue: 1,0:13:31.73,0:13:33.59,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,比最初预期的低了点
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.59,0:13:35.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 不 我问的是它怎么样
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.36,0:13:38.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,游客们开心吗 动物们享受生活吗
Dialogue: 1,0:13:38.32,0:13:42.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,游客满意度保持在90出头
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.52,0:13:46.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没有办法来衡量动物的情感体验
Dialogue: 1,0:13:46.73,0:13:49.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,当然有了 你能从它们的眼里看出来
Dialogue: 1,0:13:49.18,0:13:50.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,对吗
Dialogue: 1,0:13:50.57,0:13:51.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,当然了
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.47,0:13:56.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 现在去看看我的新恐龙
Dialogue: 1,0:14:03.83,0:14:04.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没事
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.62,0:14:06.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我控制住了
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.21,0:14:08.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,控制住了
Dialogue: 1,0:14:18.87,0:14:20.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我 我的天
Dialogue: 1,0:14:23.10,0:14:24.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你看上去很紧张 克莱尔
Dialogue: 1,0:14:25.73,0:14:28.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,也许你应该把注意力集中在驾驶上
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.69,0:14:30.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,幸福生活的关键是
Dialogue: 1,0:14:30.87,0:14:34.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,要接受你永远无法真正掌控一切的现实
Dialogue: 1,0:14:34.56,0:14:36.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,有鸟
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.57,0:14:40.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该去海边放松一天
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.95,0:14:42.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,晒晒太阳
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.31,0:14:44.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,对了
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.37,0:14:48.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,市场部认为我们可以抵消部分成本
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.27,0:14:50.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不要提成本
Dialogue: 1,0:14:50.05,0:14:52.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰·哈蒙德把他的遗愿托付给我
Dialogue: 1,0:14:52.89,0:14:54.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,可从没提过什么利润
Dialogue: 1,0:14:54.79,0:14:57.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,"不惜成本" 他过去总说
Dialogue: 1,0:14:57.14,0:14:58.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我很欣赏那样 但是
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.75,0:15:01.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上 运营一个主题公园需要
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.54,0:15:03.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了我们建造这里的初衷 克莱尔
Dialogue: 1,0:15:03.39,0:15:05.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,侏罗纪世界的存在是
Dialogue: 1,0:15:05.22,0:15:08.34,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,为了提醒我们 我们有多渺小 多么年轻
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.34,0:15:09.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这种觉悟是无法用金钱估量的
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.97,0:15:13.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,今朝能飞今朝飞
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.70,0:15:16.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,深呼吸享受吧
Dialogue: 1,0:15:43.66,0:15:45.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他还好吗
Dialogue: 1,0:15:45.06,0:15:47.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你还好吗 - 他只是有点夸张
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.24,0:15:49.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这里还在建造中吗
Dialogue: 1,0:15:50.85,0:15:52.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们打算在五月开放
Dialogue: 1,0:15:52.89,0:15:56.34,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但是资产控制部坚持要我们把墙再建高点
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.34,0:15:58.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,它的体型比预期的要大
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.12,0:16:05.92,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是个好兆头
Dialogue: 1,0:16:08.10,0:16:10.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们前段时间出了点小问题
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.94,0:16:14.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,它开始预见食物出现的方向
Dialogue: 1,0:16:14.21,0:16:16.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,有一位工作人员差点失去他的胳膊
Dialogue: 1,0:16:16.35,0:16:17.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,其他人威胁说
Dialogue: 1,0:16:17.64,0:16:19.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我不能保证他们的安全就辞职
Dialogue: 1,0:16:20.74,0:16:22.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这么说她很聪明喽
Dialogue: 1,0:16:22.91,0:16:24.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,对一个恐龙来说是那样
Dialogue: 1,0:16:24.63,0:16:26.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么
Dialogue: 1,0:16:31.32,0:16:33.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,它曾试图弄碎玻璃
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.83,0:16:36.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢她的精神
Dialogue: 1,0:16:57.57,0:17:01.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,它是白色的 你从没告诉我它是白色的
Dialogue: 1,0:17:06.49,0:17:08.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得它会吓到孩子们吗
Dialogue: 1,0:17:08.90,0:17:11.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,孩子们
Dialogue: 1,0:17:12.36,0:17:15.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这会让家长们做噩梦的
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.10,0:17:18.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是好事吗
Dialogue: 1,0:17:19.16,0:17:21.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这简直好极了
Dialogue: 1,0:17:25.60,0:17:27.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她能看到我吗
Dialogue: 1,0:17:27.25,0:17:31.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们说它可以感受到热辐射 像蛇一样
Dialogue: 1,0:17:32.67,0:17:34.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为有两头
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.71,0:17:38.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,以防它无法成活 它曾有个妹妹
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.50,0:17:39.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,妹妹在哪儿
Dialogue: 1,0:17:39.82,0:17:42.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她吃掉了
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.93,0:17:53.23,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这围场够安全吗
Dialogue: 1,0:17:53.67,0:17:57.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们请来了世界上最好的结构工程师
Dialogue: 1,0:17:57.58,0:17:59.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 哈蒙德也有过
Dialogue: 1,0:18:02.26,0:18:04.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这里有个美国海军军人
Dialogue: 1,0:18:04.58,0:18:07.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是我公司正在进行的一个研究项目的成员
Dialogue: 1,0:18:07.42,0:18:09.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,欧文·格雷迪
Dialogue: 1,0:18:10.08,0:18:11.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道他是谁
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.85,0:18:13.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他的动物经常试图逃跑
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.81,0:18:17.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,它们很聪明 所以他必须更聪明
Dialogue: 1,0:18:17.09,0:18:18.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他只认为他更聪明
Dialogue: 1,0:18:19.78,0:18:22.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我想让你带他过来
Dialogue: 1,0:18:22.56,0:18:24.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,让他检查下围场的安全度
Dialogue: 1,0:18:25.62,0:18:28.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟旁观者清
Dialogue: 1,0:18:44.90,0:18:45.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,停
Dialogue: 1,0:18:53.30,0:18:54.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿
Dialogue: 1,0:18:58.52,0:18:59.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好的
Dialogue: 1,0:18:59.63,0:19:02.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,看着我
Dialogue: 1,0:19:02.33,0:19:03.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,布鲁
Dialogue: 1,0:19:03.73,0:19:05.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,布鲁
Dialogue: 1,0:19:05.25,0:19:07.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,注意点
Dialogue: 1,0:19:07.51,0:19:09.28,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,查理 嘿
Dialogue: 1,0:19:09.28,0:19:10.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,别给我来这套
Dialogue: 1,0:19:11.51,0:19:12.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,德尔塔
Dialogue: 1,0:19:12.65,0:19:14.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,集中注意力
Dialogue: 1,0:19:14.94,0:19:16.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,很好
Dialogue: 1,0:19:17.00,0:19:19.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这边走
Dialogue: 1,0:19:26.13,0:19:27.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,停
Dialogue: 1,0:19:28.65,0:19:32.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 非常好
Dialogue: 1,0:19:33.07,0:19:34.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,很好
Dialogue: 1,0:19:34.22,0:19:36.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,查理 这是你的
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.26,0:19:38.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,艾蔻 接着
Dialogue: 1,0:19:38.80,0:19:39.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,德尔塔
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.61,0:19:43.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,布鲁
Dialogue: 1,0:19:45.71,0:19:47.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这个是给你的
Dialogue: 1,0:19:50.54,0:19:51.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,停
Dialogue: 1,0:19:53.06,0:19:54.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,抬头
Dialogue: 1,0:19:57.71,0:19:59.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,走
Dialogue: 1,0:20:05.73,0:20:07.28,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你终于成功了
Dialogue: 1,0:20:07.28,0:20:08.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,欧文
Dialogue: 1,0:20:10.57,0:20:13.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我开始以为我请错了人呢
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.31,0:20:15.26,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但是 她们完全在你的掌控之中了
Dialogue: 1,0:20:15.27,0:20:17.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你今天来得巧 不是每次结局都这么理想的
Dialogue: 1,0:20:17.48,0:20:19.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你不把这件事写进报告里的原因吗
Dialogue: 1,0:20:19.40,0:20:20.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一直很忙
Dialogue: 1,0:20:20.60,0:20:23.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,领薪水的时候倒是跑得快
Dialogue: 1,0:20:23.98,0:20:25.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你有何贵干 伙计
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.13,0:20:27.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,实地测试
Dialogue: 1,0:20:27.36,0:20:32.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 我刚刚看到他们可以对命令做出回应
Dialogue: 1,0:20:32.14,0:20:34.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要把这项研究利用起来
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.62,0:20:35.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她们是野兽 霍斯金
Dialogue: 1,0:20:35.81,0:20:37.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我 你不会希望她们参与实战的
Dialogue: 1,0:20:37.39,0:20:40.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚看到了情感联系 真正的联系
Dialogue: 1,0:20:40.64,0:20:42.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,人和野兽之间的联系
Dialogue: 1,0:20:42.54,0:20:45.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你挡我道了 - 想想看 我们都是一样的
Dialogue: 1,0:20:45.52,0:20:46.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都是战争的走狗
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.98,0:20:50.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都知道军队需要减少伤亡
Dialogue: 1,0:20:50.20,0:20:52.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一些人认为机器人才是未来
Dialogue: 1,0:20:52.45,0:20:54.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 大自然在七千五百万年前
Dialogue: 1,0:20:54.47,0:20:57.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就给了我们最有效的杀戮机器
Dialogue: 1,0:20:57.80,0:21:00.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,而现在我们知道他们可以听从指令
Dialogue: 1,0:21:00.08,0:21:02.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们刚取得进步他就说这个
Dialogue: 1,0:21:02.95,0:21:04.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,当做武器
Dialogue: 1,0:21:04.33,0:21:05.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.39,0:21:07.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,想想看 伙计们
Dialogue: 1,0:21:07.60,0:21:09.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是成年人的世界
Dialogue: 1,0:21:09.35,0:21:13.61,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,无人机不能搜索隧道和洞穴 还容易被攻击
Dialogue: 1,0:21:13.61,0:21:15.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一旦真正的战争爆发
Dialogue: 1,0:21:15.22,0:21:17.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,所有的高科技都会失效
Dialogue: 1,0:21:17.24,0:21:20.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,高科技可不会在忘了喂它之后吃了他们
Dialogue: 1,0:21:21.17,0:21:23.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,看看这些生物
Dialogue: 1,0:21:23.06,0:21:25.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,百万年来 他们的细胞里保留着
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.31,0:21:27.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那种我们可以改写的本能
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.46,0:21:30.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她们的忠诚是无法被收买的
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.27,0:21:32.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这些家伙将会径直
Dialogue: 1,0:21:32.52,0:21:34.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,跑到敌人面前吃了他们
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.98,0:21:36.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,骨头都不吐
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.27,0:21:39.34,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,要是她们想自己做主怎么办
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.34,0:21:42.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们就提醒她们自己是谁 消灭那些野兽
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.27,0:21:44.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,只保留忠诚的血脉
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.65,0:21:48.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,什么 笑什么
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.96,0:21:54.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你来这除了只想了解你想知道的事
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.25,0:21:55.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,有关这些动物你却一点都不了解
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.09,0:21:59.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你创造了她们就觉得自己拥有了她们
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.38,0:22:01.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们确实拥有她们
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.45,0:22:04.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,已经灭绝的动物没有讨价还价的余地
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.09,0:22:06.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不再是灭绝的动物了 霍斯金
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.71,0:22:09.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 我们现在坐拥的是金矿
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.82,0:22:13.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,而马斯拉尼却把这里弄成了一个宠物乐园
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.86,0:22:15.61,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他只是想让人们学会谦卑
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.61,0:22:16.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他不是为了制造武器
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.56,0:22:19.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得世界富豪排行第八的人
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.35,0:22:23.41,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,只对石油 通信和家庭主题公园感兴趣吗
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.70,0:22:25.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他的产业太多元化了 他甚至不清楚自己拥有什么
Dialogue: 1,0:22:25.88,0:22:28.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得国际基因科技公司在这个领域研究多久了
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.12,0:22:30.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,自从我们把你从海军挖过来之后
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.87,0:22:32.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道结果会是什么样子
Dialogue: 1,0:22:32.29,0:22:36.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这种动物在地面上可以代替成千上万个机器人
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.14,0:22:37.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这将会拯救多少生命
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.37,0:22:42.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,战争也是自然的一部分
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.53,0:22:46.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,看看周围 欧文 生活在这片丛林里的生物
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.84,0:22:49.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,都在互相残杀
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.46,0:22:52.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是大自然母亲检测她产物的方式
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.67,0:22:54.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,调整食物链
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.51,0:22:58.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,战争就是抗争 抗争孕育伟大
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.08,0:23:00.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没有这一切
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.53,0:23:03.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就会在这种地方庸碌一辈子 一杯的苏打水卖七块钱
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.22,0:23:06.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你自己说的话你仔细听了吗
Dialogue: 1,0:23:09.96,0:23:14.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是必然的 有没有你们都一样
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.11,0:23:15.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,进化永远是赢家 伙计
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.96,0:23:18.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,或许这种进化应该输一回了
Dialogue: 1,0:23:20.49,0:23:21.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,猪跑了
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.38,0:23:23.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,猪跑了
Dialogue: 1,0:23:42.01,0:23:43.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,欧文 不要
Dialogue: 1,0:23:46.55,0:23:48.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,别 别开火
Dialogue: 1,0:23:49.99,0:23:52.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,别开火 不要开火
Dialogue: 1,0:23:55.18,0:23:58.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,用十二安培的电流击中她们 她们就再也不会信任我了
Dialogue: 1,0:24:00.05,0:24:02.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,布鲁 退下
Dialogue: 1,0:24:03.83,0:24:05.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,退下
Dialogue: 1,0:24:06.38,0:24:08.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 嘿 我刚刚说了什么
Dialogue: 1,0:24:10.19,0:24:12.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,德尔塔 我看到你了 退后
Dialogue: 1,0:24:14.54,0:24:15.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好了
Dialogue: 1,0:24:15.83,0:24:17.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好的
Dialogue: 1,0:24:17.49,0:24:19.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,很好
Dialogue: 1,0:24:19.99,0:24:21.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,查理
Dialogue: 1,0:24:22.00,0:24:24.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,待那别动
Dialogue: 1,0:24:24.99,0:24:25.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,很好
Dialogue: 1,0:24:28.84,0:24:29.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,关上门
Dialogue: 1,0:24:29.90,0:24:31.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你疯了吗
Dialogue: 1,0:24:31.67,0:24:33.26,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我
Dialogue: 1,0:24:33.27,0:24:34.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快关门
Dialogue: 1,0:24:52.59,0:24:53.59,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 1,0:24:58.39,0:25:00.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你是新来的 对吧
Dialogue: 1,0:25:00.40,0:25:01.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 1,0:25:01.88,0:25:04.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你想过为什么这里会有个职位空缺吗
Dialogue: 1,0:25:06.56,0:25:09.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,永远别背对笼子
Dialogue: 1,0:25:53.84,0:25:55.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把我举起来 我看不到
Dialogue: 1,0:25:55.78,0:25:58.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我又不是老爸 你也不是五岁小孩
Dialogue: 1,0:25:58.48,0:26:02.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我还能骑三角龙 我才四十七点五英尺高
Dialogue: 1,0:26:03.31,0:26:04.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这个地方是给小孩子准备的
Dialogue: 1,0:26:06.21,0:26:07.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是呀 我知道
Dialogue: 1,0:26:07.34,0:26:09.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 想去转恐龙蛋吗 - 不想
Dialogue: 1,0:26:10.60,0:26:12.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,盖好你的呆子腰包
Dialogue: 1,0:26:13.33,0:26:14.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,因为这是我的婚礼
Dialogue: 1,0:26:14.42,0:26:16.77,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不行 阿莱克不会举办单身汉派对
Dialogue: 1,0:26:16.77,0:26:18.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他的朋友都是禽兽
Dialogue: 1,0:26:18.92,0:26:19.92,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,趁机快溜
Dialogue: 1,0:26:19.92,0:26:22.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么 - 走 快跑 快 快
Dialogue: 1,0:26:43.13,0:26:45.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,霸王龙的下一次喂食表演将在十分钟后开始
Dialogue: 1,0:26:45.52,0:26:47.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 霸王龙哎 快点 老哥 - 好吧
Dialogue: 1,0:26:47.83,0:26:48.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快点
Dialogue: 1,0:26:48.72,0:26:50.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,家长请注意 这个
Dialogue: 1,0:26:50.24,0:26:53.28,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,表演可能会对儿童造成不良影响
Dialogue: 1,0:27:04.45,0:27:05.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 妈妈
Dialogue: 1,0:27:05.56,0:27:08.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该在落地之后给我回电话的
Dialogue: 1,0:27:08.38,0:27:10.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,玩得开心吗
Dialogue: 1,0:27:10.76,0:27:12.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,还行吧 我觉得
Dialogue: 1,0:27:13.82,0:27:16.93,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱尔阿姨给了我们贵宾通行证 这样我们就不用排队了
Dialogue: 1,0:27:16.93,0:27:18.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 她没和你们在一起吗
Dialogue: 1,0:27:23.83,0:27:25.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 凯伦
Dialogue: 1,0:27:25.83,0:27:27.61,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 克莱尔 一切还好吗
Dialogue: 1,0:27:27.61,0:27:30.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 都挺好的 孩子们玩得很开心
Dialogue: 1,0:27:30.52,0:27:33.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,大家 大家都挺好的
Dialogue: 1,0:27:33.10,0:27:35.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗 因为我刚刚和扎克通过电话
Dialogue: 1,0:27:35.10,0:27:36.92,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他说你都没和他们在一起
Dialogue: 1,0:27:36.92,0:27:42.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 听我说 我今天真的很忙
Dialogue: 1,0:27:42.73,0:27:46.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,有人照顾他们 他们和我的助理在一起
Dialogue: 1,0:27:46.11,0:27:49.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她是英国人 所以 你知道 保姆就是英国人发明的
Dialogue: 1,0:27:52.64,0:27:53.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 你在哭吗
Dialogue: 1,0:27:55.21,0:27:58.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这本该是一个家庭团聚周末的 克莱尔
Dialogue: 1,0:27:58.10,0:28:00.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你好久没有见过他们了
Dialogue: 1,0:28:00.03,0:28:02.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道他们在一块的时候扎克会怎么待格雷
Dialogue: 1,0:28:02.32,0:28:03.92,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他会变得很刻薄
Dialogue: 1,0:28:03.92,0:28:06.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 对不起
Dialogue: 1,0:28:06.78,0:28:10.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,明天 我会花一整天的时间陪着他们
Dialogue: 1,0:28:10.21,0:28:11.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我会请一天假
Dialogue: 1,0:28:11.43,0:28:13.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我会和他们寸步不离的 我保证
Dialogue: 1,0:28:13.43,0:28:17.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,说得好不如做得好
Dialogue: 1,0:28:17.82,0:28:19.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你这是在引用妈妈的话吗
Dialogue: 1,0:28:19.90,0:28:22.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 天啊 我竟然引用了妈妈的话
Dialogue: 1,0:28:23.04,0:28:25.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 但是你知道确实是这个道理
Dialogue: 1,0:28:25.03,0:28:26.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,当你有孩子之后就明白了
Dialogue: 1,0:28:26.64,0:28:27.93,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 如果有那一天的话
Dialogue: 1,0:28:27.93,0:28:31.61,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,会有的 有孩子是件好事
Dialogue: 1,0:28:31.61,0:28:33.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,拜 妈妈
Dialogue: 1,0:28:35.36,0:28:37.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,拜
Dialogue: 1,0:28:54.34,0:28:55.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们又想干什么
Dialogue: 1,0:28:56.17,0:28:57.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,格雷迪先生
Dialogue: 1,0:28:58.27,0:29:02.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我想请你去看点东西
Dialogue: 1,0:29:03.35,0:29:05.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么叫我格雷迪先生
Dialogue: 1,0:29:05.76,0:29:07.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,欧文
Dialogue: 1,0:29:08.90,0:29:11.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 如果你不是很忙的话 - 我忙得很
Dialogue: 1,0:29:11.40,0:29:13.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们遇到了一个问题
Dialogue: 1,0:29:13.14,0:29:14.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,上一次见你 你可不是这么说的
Dialogue: 1,0:29:14.98,0:29:17.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我指的是恐龙 格雷迪先生
Dialogue: 1,0:29:17.63,0:29:18.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,叫我欧文
Dialogue: 1,0:29:18.52,0:29:21.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们创造了一个新的物种
Dialogue: 1,0:29:23.84,0:29:26.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你就这么创造了一种新的恐龙
Dialogue: 1,0:29:26.87,0:29:29.59,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 我们就是干这行的
Dialogue: 1,0:29:30.34,0:29:32.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,展览将会在三周后对外开放
Dialogue: 1,0:29:32.78,0:29:35.93,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,马斯拉尼先生想请你探讨一下
Dialogue: 1,0:29:35.93,0:29:41.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你是想在这探讨还是 在我的小屋里
Dialogue: 1,0:29:41.01,0:29:42.93,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这一点也不好笑
Dialogue: 1,0:29:44.08,0:29:45.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,有点好笑
Dialogue: 1,0:29:45.38,0:29:48.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们想请你评估一下围场的牢固程度
Dialogue: 1,0:29:48.40,0:29:49.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么找我
Dialogue: 1,0:29:49.49,0:29:52.28,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我想马斯拉尼先生觉得
Dialogue: 1,0:29:52.28,0:29:56.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,既然你能控制迅猛龙
Dialogue: 1,0:29:56.72,0:29:58.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你脑子里就知道控制
Dialogue: 1,0:29:58.29,0:30:01.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我并不控制迅猛龙 我们之间是有感情的
Dialogue: 1,0:30:01.04,0:30:03.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这基于相互尊重
Dialogue: 1,0:30:05.05,0:30:06.92,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是为什么你和我没有第二次约会
Dialogue: 1,0:30:06.92,0:30:10.77,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,什么 是我从来没想过再和你约会
Dialogue: 1,0:30:10.78,0:30:12.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,谁会把约会行程打印出来
Dialogue: 1,0:30:12.50,0:30:14.16,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是个非常有条理的人
Dialogue: 1,0:30:14.16,0:30:16.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,什么样饭局连龙舌兰都不能喝
Dialogue: 1,0:30:16.35,0:30:17.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,其实 所有的饭局都不能喝
Dialogue: 1,0:30:17.98,0:30:22.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,另外 什么样的男人会穿着沙滩裤去约会
Dialogue: 1,0:30:22.32,0:30:24.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是中美洲 热得很
Dialogue: 1,0:30:24.05,0:30:27.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 好吧 我们能把重点放在资产上吗
Dialogue: 1,0:30:27.72,0:30:28.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,资产
Dialogue: 1,0:30:30.12,0:30:33.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 我懂 这里你说的算
Dialogue: 1,0:30:33.09,0:30:34.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你有很多艰难的决定要做
Dialogue: 1,0:30:34.56,0:30:36.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,或许把这些动物当做表格上的
Dialogue: 1,0:30:36.01,0:30:38.26,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,数字会让人好受些
Dialogue: 1,0:30:38.26,0:30:41.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但她们不是 她们是有生命的
Dialogue: 1,0:30:41.45,0:30:44.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我当然知道她们是有生命的
Dialogue: 1,0:30:44.06,0:30:45.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 你在试管里创造了她们
Dialogue: 1,0:30:45.85,0:30:46.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但是她们不知道这一点
Dialogue: 1,0:30:46.96,0:30:48.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她们在想 我饿了
Dialogue: 1,0:30:48.92,0:30:53.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我要捕猎 我要啪啪啪
Dialogue: 1,0:30:54.48,0:30:59.34,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你至少能理解我说的其中一件事 对吧
Dialogue: 1,0:31:02.72,0:31:04.28,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我在车里等你
Dialogue: 1,0:31:07.91,0:31:11.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你得换件衣服了
Dialogue: 1,0:31:11.28,0:31:14.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她们对气味非常敏感
Dialogue: 1,0:31:23.77,0:31:25.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,沧龙被认为
Dialogue: 1,0:31:25.06,0:31:27.41,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是在水面附近捕猎
Dialogue: 1,0:31:27.41,0:31:30.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,任何被她捕获的动物都会被拖入水下
Dialogue: 1,0:31:30.87,0:31:36.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,包括海龟 大型鱼类 甚至小一些的沧龙
Dialogue: 1,0:31:36.32,0:31:38.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 各位 让我们看看
Dialogue: 1,0:31:38.12,0:31:41.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,今天她在进食后还饿吗
Dialogue: 1,0:31:41.44,0:31:43.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她有些害羞 所以
Dialogue: 1,0:31:43.39,0:31:46.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,友善些 在她出来后请给些掌声
Dialogue: 1,0:31:46.82,0:31:47.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,扎克
Dialogue: 1,0:31:47.82,0:31:49.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快看沧龙
Dialogue: 1,0:32:00.87,0:32:03.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 天啊 帅呆了
Dialogue: 1,0:32:06.80,0:32:08.68,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,抓紧了 我们将会
Dialogue: 1,0:32:08.68,0:32:12.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,让大家近距离看一下沧龙
Dialogue: 1,0:32:25.86,0:32:27.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她有八十八颗牙齿
Dialogue: 1,0:32:28.91,0:32:32.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 还想去看一些更刺激的东西吗 - 想啊
Dialogue: 1,0:32:39.43,0:32:42.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们几个月前就开始预售门票了
Dialogue: 1,0:32:42.53,0:32:45.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这座公园每年都需要新的噱头
Dialogue: 1,0:32:45.65,0:32:47.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这样才能不断吸引公众的兴趣
Dialogue: 1,0:32:47.85,0:32:49.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就像太空项目
Dialogue: 1,0:32:49.50,0:32:53.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,公司觉得基因改造的产物能够让人眼前一亮
Dialogue: 1,0:32:53.49,0:32:55.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她们是恐龙 已经够让人震惊了
Dialogue: 1,0:32:55.54,0:32:57.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但不是对我们的目标人群而言
Dialogue: 1,0:32:57.91,0:33:00.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,暴虐霸王龙让我们又一次备受关注
Dialogue: 1,0:33:00.84,0:33:02.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,暴虐霸王龙
Dialogue: 1,0:33:02.63,0:33:05.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要一个既吓人又易于发音的名字
Dialogue: 1,0:33:05.63,0:33:09.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该听听一个四岁的孩子说 "古似鸟龙"
Dialogue: 1,0:33:09.76,0:33:11.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该听听你自己怎么发音的
Dialogue: 1,0:33:16.85,0:33:18.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙都有哪些基因
Dialogue: 1,0:33:19.35,0:33:24.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,主要的的基因来自霸王龙 其余的是机密
Dialogue: 1,0:33:24.36,0:33:27.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们创造了一种新恐龙 但自己都不知道她是什么吗
Dialogue: 1,0:33:27.04,0:33:29.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,实验室将成品交给我们
Dialogue: 1,0:33:29.02,0:33:30.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,而我们负责向公众展示
Dialogue: 1,0:33:30.73,0:33:32.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,麻烦放下食饵吗
Dialogue: 1,0:33:32.66,0:33:34.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她在这里待多久了
Dialogue: 1,0:33:34.69,0:33:36.92,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,从出生到现在
Dialogue: 1,0:33:36.92,0:33:39.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,从来没见过围墙外的世界吗
Dialogue: 1,0:33:39.29,0:33:40.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们又不能像遛狗一样遛她
Dialogue: 1,0:33:40.66,0:33:42.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们一直喂她吃这个
Dialogue: 1,0:33:47.20,0:33:49.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,有问题吗
Dialogue: 1,0:33:49.13,0:33:52.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,被隔离的动物在成长过程中容易出现各种问题
Dialogue: 1,0:33:53.41,0:33:55.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你的迅猛龙也是在围场里长大的
Dialogue: 1,0:33:55.88,0:33:59.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但是有同伴 她们能相互交流
Dialogue: 1,0:33:59.65,0:34:01.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,而且自她们出生起 我就一直在她们身边
Dialogue: 1,0:34:01.79,0:34:03.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们相互信任
Dialogue: 1,0:34:03.06,0:34:04.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,而这头恐龙
Dialogue: 1,0:34:04.06,0:34:06.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,唯一拥有的感情羁绊就是和那台吊车了
Dialogue: 1,0:34:08.08,0:34:09.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,至少她知道那意味着食物
Dialogue: 1,0:34:09.94,0:34:12.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这么说 她需要一个朋友
Dialogue: 1,0:34:12.71,0:34:15.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该给她安排家庭活动日 或者类似的活动吗
Dialogue: 1,0:34:16.50,0:34:18.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,可能不是个好主意
Dialogue: 1,0:34:21.45,0:34:24.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 她在哪儿 - 在地下室吗
Dialogue: 1,0:34:24.94,0:34:28.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这里有没有地下一层 没准她在娱乐室玩呢
Dialogue: 1,0:34:28.52,0:34:30.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她就在这的 我们刚才还来看过
Dialogue: 1,0:34:39.29,0:34:41.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 坏了
Dialogue: 1,0:34:43.74,0:34:45.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这不对啊
Dialogue: 1,0:34:47.90,0:34:49.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这些门最近几周都没有打开过啊
Dialogue: 1,0:34:51.42,0:34:53.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这些抓痕一直都存在吗
Dialogue: 1,0:34:59.21,0:35:00.93,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得她
Dialogue: 1,0:35:03.08,0:35:05.26,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 天啊
Dialogue: 1,0:35:05.26,0:35:07.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她的后背有植入物
Dialogue: 1,0:35:07.43,0:35:09.92,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以从主控室里追踪她
Dialogue: 1,0:35:19.71,0:35:21.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有一头恐龙逃出了围场
Dialogue: 1,0:35:21.90,0:35:24.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,让武装部队待命 这不是演习
Dialogue: 1,0:35:24.80,0:35:27.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我到十三岁时才见到他
Dialogue: 1,0:35:27.73,0:35:30.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我觉得卡尔比我的亲生父亲还亲
Dialogue: 1,0:35:35.64,0:35:37.61,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 喂 你好 - 劳瑞
Dialogue: 1,0:35:37.61,0:35:39.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把暴虐霸王龙的坐标调出来
Dialogue: 1,0:35:40.65,0:35:41.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好的
Dialogue: 1,0:35:43.21,0:35:44.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在就调
Dialogue: 1,0:36:08.49,0:36:10.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这墙有四十英尺高
Dialogue: 1,0:36:10.40,0:36:12.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会真觉得她能爬出去吧
Dialogue: 1,0:36:13.61,0:36:14.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那得看情况
Dialogue: 1,0:36:14.96,0:36:16.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,什么情况
Dialogue: 1,0:36:16.75,0:36:20.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,看他们在实验室里到底创造的是什么恐龙
Dialogue: 1,0:36:22.16,0:36:23.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 什么情况
Dialogue: 1,0:36:24.55,0:36:26.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她在围场里
Dialogue: 1,0:36:26.13,0:36:28.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不可能 我刚刚就在那儿啊
Dialogue: 1,0:36:28.49,0:36:31.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱尔 不会错的 她就在围场里
Dialogue: 1,0:36:32.07,0:36:33.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,等等
Dialogue: 1,0:36:33.20,0:36:34.93,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,围场里有人
Dialogue: 1,0:36:36.78,0:36:38.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快让他们出来
Dialogue: 1,0:36:38.98,0:36:40.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快
Dialogue: 1,0:36:40.56,0:36:42.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,十一号围场 这里是控制中心
Dialogue: 1,0:36:42.13,0:36:44.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,请你们马上撤离围场
Dialogue: 1,0:36:44.49,0:36:45.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,十一号围场
Dialogue: 1,0:36:45.90,0:36:48.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,十一号围场 你收到了吗
Dialogue: 1,0:36:48.85,0:36:50.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,收到 怎么了
Dialogue: 1,0:36:50.14,0:36:51.77,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她在围场里 她和你们在一起
Dialogue: 1,0:36:51.77,0:36:53.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快跑
Dialogue: 1,0:37:22.30,0:37:23.41,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,关上门
Dialogue: 1,0:37:23.41,0:37:25.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能把他和那个怪物关在一起
Dialogue: 1,0:37:25.02,0:37:25.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快点关上
Dialogue: 1,0:37:25.58,0:37:28.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们倒是说句话啊 到底怎么了
Dialogue: 1,0:37:29.81,0:37:30.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的
Dialogue: 1,0:39:41.25,0:39:45.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,所有人保持冷静
Dialogue: 1,0:39:52.81,0:39:54.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,如果她离边界围栏太近
Dialogue: 1,0:39:54.31,0:39:56.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,植入物就会电击她
Dialogue: 1,0:39:56.83,0:39:58.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 但她真得移动很快
Dialogue: 1,0:39:58.38,0:40:00.41,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这里是控制中心 发出全园警报
Dialogue: 1,0:40:00.43,0:40:01.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把电话挂了
Dialogue: 1,0:40:01.98,0:40:04.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 刚得到新消息 一切正常
Dialogue: 1,0:40:04.98,0:40:06.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,让资产控制部门悄悄的捕获她
Dialogue: 1,0:40:06.76,0:40:10.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这座公园建成之初就具备了
Dialogue: 1,0:40:10.63,0:40:12.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,处理这种紧急情况的能力
Dialogue: 1,0:40:12.56,0:40:14.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是偶然事件 明白吗
Dialogue: 1,0:40:14.54,0:40:16.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该把这点写进观光手册里
Dialogue: 1,0:40:16.22,0:40:19.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,"最终 总有一头恐龙会把人给吃了"
Dialogue: 1,0:40:19.99,0:40:23.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那个围场距最近的景区四英里远
Dialogue: 1,0:40:23.29,0:40:25.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,装甲部队能控制住局面 不会再有人被
Dialogue: 1,0:40:25.95,0:40:27.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,吃掉吗
Dialogue: 1,0:40:43.24,0:40:45.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她们能跑多快
Dialogue: 1,0:40:45.96,0:40:47.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,时速四十公里
Dialogue: 1,0:40:47.29,0:40:49.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,饿的时候能达到每小时五十公里
Dialogue: 1,0:40:50.86,0:40:53.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你之前把她们放出来过吗 见识过她们的能耐吗
Dialogue: 1,0:40:53.78,0:40:54.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没有
Dialogue: 1,0:40:54.89,0:40:56.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 该死
Dialogue: 1,0:40:56.81,0:40:59.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,真是吓了我一跳
Dialogue: 1,0:40:59.72,0:41:02.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得怎么样 想带一头回家吗
Dialogue: 1,0:41:02.45,0:41:03.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 不是开玩笑
Dialogue: 1,0:41:03.53,0:41:05.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我像你这么大的时候
Dialogue: 1,0:41:06.05,0:41:08.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,救了一只小狼崽
Dialogue: 1,0:41:08.30,0:41:12.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,它大概 两个月大吧 几乎还不会走路
Dialogue: 1,0:41:12.32,0:41:15.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,它以前就睡在我的床边
Dialogue: 1,0:41:15.01,0:41:16.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,守护着我
Dialogue: 1,0:41:17.59,0:41:20.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我的妻子 她拿着一把牛排刀走向我时
Dialogue: 1,0:41:20.88,0:41:23.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,它从她胳膊上咬下了一块肉
Dialogue: 1,0:41:23.84,0:41:24.93,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你杀了它吗
Dialogue: 1,0:41:25.90,0:41:27.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,当然没有
Dialogue: 1,0:41:28.08,0:41:31.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们之间有种不可动摇的羁绊 你知道吗
Dialogue: 1,0:41:31.49,0:41:33.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就像你和
Dialogue: 1,0:41:34.79,0:41:36.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他叫什么名字
Dialogue: 1,0:41:36.59,0:41:39.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,德尔塔 她是个女孩
Dialogue: 1,0:41:39.52,0:41:41.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我能不能
Dialogue: 1,0:41:52.84,0:41:54.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 哇哦
Dialogue: 1,0:42:01.71,0:42:03.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,十九号警报
Dialogue: 1,0:42:03.45,0:42:06.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是那头新恐龙 - 牺牲了两位工作人员
Dialogue: 1,0:42:06.15,0:42:07.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 十九号警报是什么 - 暴虐霸王龙
Dialogue: 1,0:42:07.66,0:42:08.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,资产从围场逃出来了
Dialogue: 1,0:42:08.66,0:42:12.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这些人从不吸取教训
Dialogue: 1,0:42:14.28,0:42:15.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们现在可得
Dialogue: 1,0:42:15.55,0:42:17.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,从这头暴虐龙身上好好学学了
Dialogue: 1,0:42:20.39,0:42:25.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 是我 我们现在可能有机会了
Dialogue: 1,0:42:44.09,0:42:45.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们以前来过这儿吗
Dialogue: 1,0:42:48.00,0:42:49.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,如果爸爸妈妈离婚了
Dialogue: 1,0:42:49.29,0:42:51.61,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会不会一个跟着妈妈 一个跟着爸爸
Dialogue: 1,0:42:51.61,0:42:54.16,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,什么 你为什么这么说
Dialogue: 1,0:42:54.16,0:42:55.16,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他们要离婚了
Dialogue: 1,0:42:55.16,0:42:58.23,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不 他们不会 他们不会离婚的
Dialogue: 1,0:42:59.34,0:43:01.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说 你在他们身边待的时间不长
Dialogue: 1,0:43:01.02,0:43:02.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们总是那个样子
Dialogue: 1,0:43:02.63,0:43:04.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们收到了不同律师的信件
Dialogue: 1,0:43:04.63,0:43:06.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那也说明不了什么
Dialogue: 1,0:43:06.06,0:43:08.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我上网查过 他们都是离婚律师
Dialogue: 1,0:43:11.58,0:43:12.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 随便你
Dialogue: 1,0:43:12.94,0:43:15.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗 这不重要
Dialogue: 1,0:43:15.11,0:43:18.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗 我两年之后就要离开家了
Dialogue: 1,0:43:18.01,0:43:20.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我所有朋友的父母都离婚了
Dialogue: 1,0:43:22.39,0:43:24.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 别这样
Dialogue: 1,0:43:25.10,0:43:26.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你要哭了吗
Dialogue: 1,0:43:27.87,0:43:29.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 所有的东西你都能得到两份
Dialogue: 1,0:43:29.96,0:43:32.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,对吗 过两个生日 两个感恩节 两个
Dialogue: 1,0:43:32.78,0:43:35.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想什么都要两份
Dialogue: 1,0:43:35.47,0:43:37.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但这不是你能决定的
Dialogue: 1,0:43:38.57,0:43:40.92,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你总归要长大的
Dialogue: 1,0:44:11.60,0:44:12.92,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,请出示您的证件
Dialogue: 1,0:44:12.92,0:44:14.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,先生 先生 请出示您的证件
Dialogue: 1,0:44:14.03,0:44:15.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,外面到底发生了什么
Dialogue: 1,0:44:15.18,0:44:15.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,先生
Dialogue: 1,0:44:15.69,0:44:17.77,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那个围场周围到处都是热感摄像机
Dialogue: 1,0:44:17.77,0:44:19.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她不可能凭空消失
Dialogue: 1,0:44:20.97,0:44:23.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一定是出现了什么技术故障
Dialogue: 1,0:44:23.65,0:44:24.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你没看到吗
Dialogue: 1,0:44:24.94,0:44:26.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她在墙上留下爪印分散注意力
Dialogue: 1,0:44:26.95,0:44:28.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她想让我们以为她逃跑了
Dialogue: 1,0:44:28.66,0:44:31.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 我们现在谈论的是一只动物
Dialogue: 1,0:44:31.02,0:44:34.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 一只高智商动物 - 距离目标四百米
Dialogue: 1,0:44:58.34,0:45:00.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们居然用非致命武器追捕她
Dialogue: 1,0:45:00.32,0:45:03.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在这只恐龙身上投资了2600万
Dialogue: 1,0:45:03.06,0:45:04.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能就这么把她杀了
Dialogue: 1,0:45:04.46,0:45:05.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那些人会死的
Dialogue: 1,0:45:05.87,0:45:07.26,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,距离目标三百米
Dialogue: 1,0:45:07.26,0:45:09.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 立刻取消这个任务 - 他们能够处理好的
Dialogue: 1,0:45:09.64,0:45:13.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 立刻取消任务 - 这里不是你说了算
Dialogue: 1,0:45:44.72,0:45:46.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,血液还未凝结
Dialogue: 1,0:45:46.69,0:45:47.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她就在这附近
Dialogue: 1,0:45:48.98,0:45:50.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么
Dialogue: 1,0:45:51.86,0:45:54.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那是她体内的追踪器 她把它挖出来了
Dialogue: 1,0:45:54.62,0:45:56.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她怎么知道这么做
Dialogue: 1,0:45:57.67,0:46:00.26,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她记得把追踪器植入了哪里
Dialogue: 1,0:46:33.25,0:46:35.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她会伪装
Dialogue: 1,0:47:31.51,0:47:33.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,疏散整座岛屿
Dialogue: 1,0:47:34.68,0:47:36.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那样我们会倒闭的
Dialogue: 1,0:47:36.20,0:47:40.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们制造出了一头基因混血恐龙 在封闭的空间将她养大
Dialogue: 1,0:47:40.84,0:47:43.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她头一次接触外面的一切
Dialogue: 1,0:47:43.51,0:47:46.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她甚至不知道自己是什么
Dialogue: 1,0:47:46.22,0:47:49.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她会杀了所有一切会动的东西
Dialogue: 1,0:47:49.04,0:47:52.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你认为她是在刷存在感吗
Dialogue: 1,0:47:52.30,0:47:54.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她在找寻自己处于食物链的哪一环节
Dialogue: 1,0:47:54.29,0:47:56.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为你们不会希望她弄明白的
Dialogue: 1,0:47:56.30,0:47:57.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,资产控制部门
Dialogue: 1,0:47:57.73,0:48:00.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,能在紧急状况下可以使用实弹
Dialogue: 1,0:48:00.25,0:48:02.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们的军械库里有M134机枪
Dialogue: 1,0:48:02.10,0:48:04.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把它装到直升机上 然后干掉这个家伙
Dialogue: 1,0:48:04.46,0:48:05.61,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这里有许多家庭
Dialogue: 1,0:48:05.61,0:48:07.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会把这里变成战场的
Dialogue: 1,0:48:07.55,0:48:08.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这里已经是战场了
Dialogue: 1,0:48:08.79,0:48:10.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,格雷迪先生 如果你不准备帮忙
Dialogue: 1,0:48:10.50,0:48:12.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就没理由继续待在这里了
Dialogue: 1,0:48:19.35,0:48:22.28,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我要和实验室里的人谈一谈
Dialogue: 1,0:48:22.28,0:48:26.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,外面的那个东西 那不是恐龙
Dialogue: 1,0:48:44.92,0:48:48.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,关闭景区北部的所有设施
Dialogue: 1,0:48:48.95,0:48:52.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是一级戒备 不是演习 请全体出动
Dialogue: 1,0:48:52.70,0:48:55.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是一级戒备 不是演习 重复一遍 这是一级戒备
Dialogue: 1,0:48:55.74,0:48:57.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把所有游客召回
Dialogue: 1,0:49:01.29,0:49:02.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,软组织被保存了下来
Dialogue: 1,0:49:02.30,0:49:03.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,因为恐龙血液里含铁
Dialogue: 1,0:49:03.86,0:49:07.26,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,铁能产生活跃的自由基
Dialogue: 1,0:49:07.26,0:49:10.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,蛋白质和细胞膜相结合
Dialogue: 1,0:49:10.21,0:49:12.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,起到了天然的保护作用
Dialogue: 1,0:49:12.42,0:49:14.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,DNA能通过那种方式保存上千年
Dialogue: 1,0:49:14.98,0:49:17.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,即使琥珀干涸了 他们仍有骨头
Dialogue: 1,0:49:17.80,0:49:18.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 1,0:49:21.13,0:49:24.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你这么盯着她们有什么用
Dialogue: 1,0:49:26.98,0:49:29.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 多谢了 伙计 - 不客气
Dialogue: 1,0:49:32.14,0:49:33.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一路顺风
Dialogue: 1,0:49:37.45,0:49:39.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,孕妇以及患有晕船晕机症的游客
Dialogue: 1,0:49:39.86,0:49:42.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在乘坐此观光设施前需咨询医生
Dialogue: 1,0:49:54.59,0:49:55.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一路顺风
Dialogue: 1,0:49:58.34,0:49:59.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: 1,0:50:02.59,0:50:04.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗
Dialogue: 1,0:50:05.88,0:50:08.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 各位 观光项目停止运行
Dialogue: 1,0:50:09.88,0:50:13.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,请各位乘坐单轨列车撤离
Dialogue: 1,0:50:16.80,0:50:19.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 各位 我只是个打工的
Dialogue: 1,0:50:19.12,0:50:23.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,由于技术故障 所有设施现在停止运行
Dialogue: 1,0:50:31.13,0:50:32.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我不能
Dialogue: 1,0:50:32.48,0:50:34.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,随意透露资产的基因成分
Dialogue: 1,0:50:35.54,0:50:38.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,改良后的动物是不可预测的
Dialogue: 1,0:50:39.15,0:50:40.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她杀了人 亨利
Dialogue: 1,0:50:41.96,0:50:43.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那真是不幸
Dialogue: 1,0:50:43.67,0:50:47.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们为什么要创造一头能伪装自己的恐龙
Dialogue: 1,0:50:47.83,0:50:49.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她的体内加入了乌贼基因
Dialogue: 1,0:50:49.54,0:50:52.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,帮助减缓快速的生长率
Dialogue: 1,0:50:52.64,0:50:54.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,乌贼体内含有能使
Dialogue: 1,0:50:54.64,0:50:57.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,皮肤变色的色素体
Dialogue: 1,0:50:57.61,0:51:00.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她躲过了热感探测
Dialogue: 1,0:51:00.92,0:51:02.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗
Dialogue: 1,0:51:02.05,0:51:03.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这怎么可能
Dialogue: 1,0:51:07.83,0:51:10.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,树蛙能控制红外线输出
Dialogue: 1,0:51:10.60,0:51:12.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们提取了一些它们的DNA
Dialogue: 1,0:51:12.26,0:51:14.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,帮助她适应热带气候
Dialogue: 1,0:51:14.74,0:51:16.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我从没想到
Dialogue: 1,0:51:16.73,0:51:18.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,谁让你这么做的
Dialogue: 1,0:51:19.45,0:51:20.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你啊
Dialogue: 1,0:51:20.71,0:51:22.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,"更大"
Dialogue: 1,0:51:22.22,0:51:23.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,"更可怕"
Dialogue: 1,0:51:23.88,0:51:29.41,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,"更酷" 我想这是你在备注里用到的字眼吧
Dialogue: 1,0:51:29.41,0:51:33.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在没有对应的行为特征下
Dialogue: 1,0:51:33.12,0:51:35.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是不可能出现一个暴力型食肉动物的
Dialogue: 1,0:51:35.90,0:51:37.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在所做的一切
Dialogue: 1,0:51:37.35,0:51:40.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,和你已经做过的事
Dialogue: 1,0:51:41.53,0:51:43.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,董事会会关了这座公园
Dialogue: 1,0:51:43.22,0:51:45.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,夺走你的工作和你所建立的一切
Dialogue: 1,0:51:46.83,0:51:48.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哈蒙德这次可保护不了你
Dialogue: 1,0:51:48.70,0:51:52.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这一切都是因为我才得以存在
Dialogue: 1,0:51:53.26,0:51:56.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我不创新 自然会有其他人这么做
Dialogue: 1,0:51:57.32,0:52:01.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你要立刻终止这里的所有研究
Dialogue: 1,0:52:02.11,0:52:05.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你说得好像我们在做什么疯狂的实验
Dialogue: 1,0:52:05.86,0:52:09.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们做的从头到尾都没变过
Dialogue: 1,0:52:09.72,0:52:13.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,侏罗纪世界里的一切都不是天然的
Dialogue: 1,0:52:13.09,0:52:14.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们总是在恐龙的基因组里
Dialogue: 1,0:52:14.56,0:52:17.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,加入其他动物的DNA
Dialogue: 1,0:52:17.06,0:52:19.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,还有 如果她们的基因序列没有被改动
Dialogue: 1,0:52:19.08,0:52:21.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,许多恐龙看上去会很不一样
Dialogue: 1,0:52:21.32,0:52:23.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你并没有要求真实性 你要的是更多牙齿
Dialogue: 1,0:52:23.91,0:52:26.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我从未说过要制造出一个怪物 - "怪物" 是一个相对的词语
Dialogue: 1,0:52:26.78,0:52:29.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,对于金丝雀来说 猫就是怪物
Dialogue: 1,0:52:29.52,0:52:33.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只不过是习惯把自己当猫罢了
Dialogue: 1,0:52:37.32,0:52:39.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 你们好 我是吉米·肥伦
Dialogue: 1,0:52:39.13,0:52:40.77,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎乘坐陀螺球
Dialogue: 1,0:52:40.77,0:52:43.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是一台由科学创造出来的神奇机器
Dialogue: 1,0:52:43.18,0:52:44.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们最关心的是你们的安全
Dialogue: 1,0:52:44.85,0:52:47.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,因此这个球体是个隐形屏障系统
Dialogue: 1,0:52:47.10,0:52:50.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,它能保护你们不受像双脊龙毒液那样的伤害
Dialogue: 1,0:52:50.91,0:52:54.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一小滴毒液就能让你瘫痪 所以小心点
Dialogue: 1,0:52:54.76,0:52:57.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是真的毒液吗 是吗
Dialogue: 1,0:52:57.76,0:52:59.59,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,作为额外保护 每个陀螺球外面
Dialogue: 1,0:52:59.59,0:53:02.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,都有一层氮氧化氯玻璃
Dialogue: 1,0:53:02.71,0:53:05.77,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,玻璃十分坚硬 能挡住一颗50口径的子弹
Dialogue: 1,0:53:08.93,0:53:12.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,陀螺技术能让你保持直立状态
Dialogue: 1,0:53:12.10,0:53:13.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她们在哪儿
Dialogue: 1,0:53:13.29,0:53:14.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,所以没什么可担心的
Dialogue: 1,0:53:14.72,0:53:15.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 天呐
Dialogue: 1,0:53:51.49,0:53:55.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,由于技术故障 所有设施现在停止运行
Dialogue: 1,0:53:55.72,0:53:59.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,请离开所有观光设施并返回度假区
Dialogue: 1,0:54:01.90,0:54:04.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,别叹气啊 我们还能在外面多待一会儿
Dialogue: 1,0:54:05.24,0:54:07.26,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,可是他们说要关闭设施
Dialogue: 1,0:54:07.26,0:54:09.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱尔阿姨给了我们贵宾腕带 不是吗
Dialogue: 1,0:54:09.56,0:54:10.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是贵宾 老弟
Dialogue: 1,0:54:11.82,0:54:14.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没事 会很有意思的
Dialogue: 1,0:54:45.04,0:54:46.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 喂 - 扎拉
Dialogue: 1,0:54:47.27,0:54:49.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你现在立刻把孩子们带回宾馆
Dialogue: 1,0:54:49.46,0:54:51.59,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道 我在到处找他们
Dialogue: 1,0:54:52.10,0:54:53.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,慢一点 我听不清你在说什么
Dialogue: 1,0:54:53.74,0:54:55.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,扎克和格雷 他们逃跑了
Dialogue: 1,0:54:55.08,0:54:56.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 1,0:55:00.98,0:55:02.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 克莱尔
Dialogue: 1,0:55:03.39,0:55:05.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,扎克 谢天谢地 格雷和你在一起吗
Dialogue: 1,0:55:05.98,0:55:09.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我听不清你在说什么 我们在仓鼠球里
Dialogue: 1,0:55:09.64,0:55:11.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 扎克 听我说
Dialogue: 1,0:55:11.55,0:55:12.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你
Dialogue: 1,0:55:13.77,0:55:15.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: 1,0:55:15.62,0:55:17.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 喂 - 扎克
Dialogue: 1,0:55:21.70,0:55:23.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,山谷里还有没归位的陀螺球吗
Dialogue: 1,0:55:23.64,0:55:25.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没有了 我都清点过了 这是我的工作
Dialogue: 1,0:55:25.38,0:55:25.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 1,0:55:25.98,0:55:27.68,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,还有一个没有回来
Dialogue: 1,0:55:28.52,0:55:30.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,派一队突击队员把他们带回来
Dialogue: 1,0:55:30.60,0:55:32.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,安保部门 我们正在山谷里进行搜救
Dialogue: 1,0:55:32.58,0:55:34.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,要等一会儿 我们现在已经忙不过来了
Dialogue: 1,0:55:35.48,0:55:37.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 不 有两名游客失踪了
Dialogue: 1,0:55:37.85,0:55:39.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们需要优先处理这件事情
Dialogue: 1,0:55:39.77,0:55:41.16,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 就照她说的做吧 伙计 - 有许多游客都失踪了
Dialogue: 1,0:55:41.16,0:55:42.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在尽力搜救
Dialogue: 1,0:55:42.17,0:55:44.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我自己去
Dialogue: 1,0:55:44.08,0:55:45.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 你觉得我是你现在
Dialogue: 1,0:55:45.42,0:55:47.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,需要担心的人吗
Dialogue: 1,0:55:47.72,0:55:48.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,走开
Dialogue: 1,0:55:56.77,0:55:58.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这里发生了什么
Dialogue: 1,0:56:01.66,0:56:03.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,老弟
Dialogue: 1,0:56:03.12,0:56:04.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,去探险吧
Dialogue: 1,0:56:04.91,0:56:07.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,可是他们让我们回去
Dialogue: 1,0:56:07.13,0:56:08.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是担心
Dialogue: 1,0:56:08.94,0:56:11.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你在侏罗纪世界玩得不尽兴
Dialogue: 1,0:56:27.44,0:56:28.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱尔
Dialogue: 1,0:56:29.73,0:56:31.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我需要你 - 好的
Dialogue: 1,0:56:31.75,0:56:32.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你的帮助
Dialogue: 1,0:56:32.75,0:56:34.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我的外甥们 他们还在山谷里
Dialogue: 1,0:56:34.31,0:56:35.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你 如果他们有任何闪失
Dialogue: 1,0:56:37.97,0:56:38.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们多大了
Dialogue: 1,0:56:38.81,0:56:44.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,大一点的那个是高中生 小一点的那个 他
Dialogue: 1,0:56:44.91,0:56:48.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他大概小几岁 - 你不知道你的外甥几岁吗
Dialogue: 1,0:56:49.67,0:56:51.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 这不是个好主意
Dialogue: 1,0:56:51.72,0:56:54.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是个好主意 - 不 我们会被抓起来的
Dialogue: 1,0:56:54.84,0:56:55.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会剃光我们的头发 然后
Dialogue: 1,0:56:55.97,0:56:57.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会在厕所里做根汁饮料的
Dialogue: 1,0:56:57.95,0:56:59.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你胡说什么呢
Dialogue: 1,0:57:00.83,0:57:01.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,看那儿
Dialogue: 1,0:57:01.75,0:57:04.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,看见没 我跟你说过
Dialogue: 1,0:57:06.38,0:57:08.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不谢哦 能亲眼近距离地看到
Dialogue: 1,0:57:08.24,0:57:11.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,四只恐龙
Dialogue: 1,0:57:11.96,0:57:13.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是甲龙
Dialogue: 1,0:57:13.66,0:57:17.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不应该来这里 而且有五只恐龙
Dialogue: 1,0:57:17.76,0:57:20.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是学霸吗 数学没学好吗 看着
Dialogue: 1,0:57:20.81,0:57:23.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一 二 三
Dialogue: 1,0:57:23.30,0:57:24.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,四
Dialogue: 1,0:57:24.35,0:57:26.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,五
Dialogue: 1,0:57:37.82,0:57:40.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 走 走 快走 - 该死
Dialogue: 1,0:57:48.38,0:57:49.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,抓紧了 兄弟
Dialogue: 1,0:57:57.75,0:58:00.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,开啊 快开 快走
Dialogue: 1,0:58:31.04,0:58:33.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在这里很安全 对吗
Dialogue: 1,0:58:33.08,0:58:34.68,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,对 这里绝对安全
Dialogue: 1,0:58:39.49,0:58:40.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快点
Dialogue: 1,0:58:41.08,0:58:43.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,接电话 接电话 快接电话
Dialogue: 1,0:58:50.46,0:58:51.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,扎克
Dialogue: 1,0:58:51.57,0:58:52.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我就要拿到了
Dialogue: 1,0:58:52.57,0:58:53.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 扎克 - 怎么了
Dialogue: 1,0:58:53.95,0:58:54.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,看
Dialogue: 1,0:58:54.95,0:58:55.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 1,0:59:50.77,0:59:52.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快 快跑
Dialogue: 1,1:00:15.11,1:00:16.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们得跳下去 - 我不行
Dialogue: 1,1:00:16.37,1:00:20.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了吗 一 二 跳
Dialogue: 1,1:01:09.72,1:01:11.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你跳下来了
Dialogue: 1,1:01:31.37,1:01:32.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,待在车里
Dialogue: 1,1:02:03.96,1:02:04.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨
Dialogue: 1,1:02:04.98,1:02:07.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨
Dialogue: 1,1:02:20.16,1:02:22.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 我懂
Dialogue: 1,1:02:32.73,1:02:34.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没事了
Dialogue: 1,1:02:34.36,1:02:36.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没事的 姑娘
Dialogue: 1,1:02:53.03,1:02:53.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好了
Dialogue: 1,1:02:53.79,1:02:56.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 好了
Dialogue: 1,1:02:56.03,1:02:58.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没事了 没事了
Dialogue: 1,1:03:51.45,1:03:52.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她没有吃掉她们
Dialogue: 1,1:03:54.05,1:03:56.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她只是杀了她们用来消遣
Dialogue: 1,1:04:03.68,1:04:05.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,各部门待命 准备出发
Dialogue: 1,1:04:05.62,1:04:07.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 推迟实况转播
Dialogue: 1,1:04:07.48,1:04:09.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,现在出现了新情况
Dialogue: 1,1:04:09.55,1:04:11.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们批准你这么做了吗
Dialogue: 1,1:04:11.73,1:04:12.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会的
Dialogue: 1,1:04:19.26,1:04:22.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,欧文 这里有新情况
Dialogue: 1,1:04:29.02,1:04:30.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 你们好 我是吉米·肥伦
Dialogue: 1,1:04:30.64,1:04:32.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎乘坐陀螺球
Dialogue: 1,1:04:32.18,1:04:34.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是一台由科学创造出来的神奇机器
Dialogue: 1,1:04:35.60,1:04:38.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 你们好 我们最关心的是你们的安全
Dialogue: 1,1:04:38.08,1:04:40.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,现在放轻松 享受观光吧
Dialogue: 1,1:05:00.69,1:05:03.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 不
Dialogue: 1,1:05:06.46,1:05:07.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿
Dialogue: 1,1:05:08.11,1:05:09.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们逃出去了
Dialogue: 1,1:05:22.52,1:05:24.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 天呐 他们跳下去了
Dialogue: 1,1:05:24.19,1:05:25.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,真勇敢
Dialogue: 1,1:05:25.76,1:05:28.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,扎克 格雷
Dialogue: 1,1:05:29.27,1:05:31.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 我可不是你训练的动物
Dialogue: 1,1:05:31.51,1:05:34.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 那两个孩子还活着
Dialogue: 1,1:05:34.21,1:05:38.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但是如果你继续这么叫下去的话 我们俩的命可保不住了
Dialogue: 1,1:05:39.29,1:05:42.23,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那么 你能识别他们的气味
Dialogue: 1,1:05:42.23,1:05:45.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,对吗 能追踪他们的脚印吗
Dialogue: 1,1:05:45.36,1:05:47.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我以前是海军 又不是印第安纳瓦霍人
Dialogue: 1,1:05:47.12,1:05:49.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们该怎么办 你说我们该怎么办
Dialogue: 1,1:05:49.21,1:05:50.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你回去 我去找他们
Dialogue: 1,1:05:50.99,1:05:52.59,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我们一起去找他们
Dialogue: 1,1:05:52.59,1:05:54.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你在丛林里活不过两分钟
Dialogue: 1,1:05:54.98,1:05:57.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,况且 你还穿着恨天高
Dialogue: 1,1:06:11.27,1:06:12.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么意思
Dialogue: 1,1:06:13.95,1:06:16.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,意思是我准备好了
Dialogue: 1,1:06:17.06,1:06:18.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧
Dialogue: 1,1:06:19.31,1:06:21.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,让我把话先说清楚 在外面我说了算
Dialogue: 1,1:06:21.50,1:06:23.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你要听我的 完完全全听我的
Dialogue: 1,1:06:23.40,1:06:25.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你说什么 - 放松
Dialogue: 1,1:06:27.32,1:06:29.92,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就像是在丛林里散步一样
Dialogue: 1,1:06:31.30,1:06:33.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,六千五百万年前
Dialogue: 1,1:07:09.06,1:07:10.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,待这别动
Dialogue: 1,1:08:00.69,1:08:01.92,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哇
Dialogue: 1,1:08:37.71,1:08:39.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你身上还有火柴吗
Dialogue: 1,1:08:41.73,1:08:42.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,给你
Dialogue: 1,1:09:07.15,1:09:08.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,格雷
Dialogue: 1,1:09:38.77,1:09:42.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,92年的吉普牧马人 沙黄色
Dialogue: 1,1:09:45.27,1:09:48.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你还记得我们一起修过爷爷那辆旧迈锐宝吗
Dialogue: 1,1:09:48.48,1:09:50.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,记得
Dialogue: 1,1:09:59.00,1:10:01.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,每当她屠杀完 都会向南行进
Dialogue: 1,1:10:01.91,1:10:02.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她冲着公园来了
Dialogue: 1,1:10:02.87,1:10:04.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她为什么要来这儿
Dialogue: 1,1:10:04.44,1:10:06.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她能感觉到热辐射
Dialogue: 1,1:10:06.32,1:10:09.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的应急措施刚好把所有热量集中在了一处
Dialogue: 1,1:10:11.61,1:10:13.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 先生 - 生物工程公司
Dialogue: 1,1:10:14.90,1:10:15.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是霍斯金
Dialogue: 1,1:10:16.80,1:10:18.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你是谁
Dialogue: 1,1:10:18.24,1:10:20.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那你也应该知道我为什么过来
Dialogue: 1,1:10:22.27,1:10:23.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经从事一项恐龙
Dialogue: 1,1:10:23.27,1:10:24.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,应用项目两年之久
Dialogue: 1,1:10:26.24,1:10:29.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她们能追捕并杀了那头混血恐龙
Dialogue: 1,1:10:29.20,1:10:31.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你的项目是测试她们的智力
Dialogue: 1,1:10:31.65,1:10:33.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,确实如此 而且我们也做到了
Dialogue: 1,1:10:33.22,1:10:36.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在这过程中 我们还发现了一些别的东西
Dialogue: 1,1:10:36.91,1:10:38.68,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她们能听从命令
Dialogue: 1,1:10:39.34,1:10:40.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你看 解决你燃眉之急的
Dialogue: 1,1:10:40.82,1:10:43.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,方法就摆在你面前
Dialogue: 1,1:10:44.37,1:10:46.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,让我把话说清楚
Dialogue: 1,1:10:46.75,1:10:51.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不能让迅猛龙在这座岛上自由行动
Dialogue: 1,1:10:51.75,1:10:52.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 该死
Dialogue: 1,1:10:52.91,1:10:54.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你脑子有问题
Dialogue: 1,1:10:54.62,1:10:56.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你打算怎么处理这些人
Dialogue: 1,1:10:56.04,1:10:57.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这里有两万人 你打算怎么办
Dialogue: 1,1:10:57.94,1:10:59.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们没有地方可去
Dialogue: 1,1:11:00.42,1:11:02.26,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那头恐龙就是杀人机器
Dialogue: 1,1:11:04.98,1:11:07.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,而且她不会停止的
Dialogue: 1,1:11:08.69,1:11:09.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧
Dialogue: 1,1:11:09.66,1:11:11.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我有兴趣听听你的计划
Dialogue: 1,1:11:11.95,1:11:13.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但是要遵照公司的道德原则
Dialogue: 1,1:11:13.74,1:11:16.77,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,来结束她的生命
Dialogue: 1,1:11:19.35,1:11:21.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 老板
Dialogue: 1,1:11:22.49,1:11:24.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你下一步计划是什么
Dialogue: 1,1:11:33.79,1:11:35.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,老板 我联系不上你的驾驶教练
Dialogue: 1,1:11:35.74,1:11:39.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,算了 他可能已经撤离了
Dialogue: 1,1:11:39.24,1:11:41.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定没有别人能开直升飞机了吗
Dialogue: 1,1:11:42.97,1:11:45.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不需要别人
Dialogue: 1,1:12:07.54,1:12:08.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得她就在外面吗
Dialogue: 1,1:12:14.12,1:12:16.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说 我知道
Dialogue: 1,1:12:16.17,1:12:19.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她肯定不在外面 好吗
Dialogue: 1,1:12:19.63,1:12:21.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们绝对安全
Dialogue: 1,1:12:21.52,1:12:24.41,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,给 拿着这个
Dialogue: 1,1:12:26.11,1:12:27.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你比我坚强
Dialogue: 1,1:12:39.00,1:12:41.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 启动试试
Dialogue: 1,1:12:44.55,1:12:45.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,成了
Dialogue: 1,1:12:52.07,1:12:53.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是没通过驾照考试吗
Dialogue: 1,1:12:53.81,1:12:56.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,只是科二没过而已
Dialogue: 1,1:13:14.04,1:13:15.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是他们的东西吗
Dialogue: 1,1:13:15.71,1:13:16.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 1,1:13:17.79,1:13:20.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那条路直通公园
Dialogue: 1,1:13:22.98,1:13:25.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是怎么把这玩意开走的
Dialogue: 1,1:15:09.17,1:15:11.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,劳瑞 我们找到她了
Dialogue: 1,1:15:11.47,1:15:13.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,陀螺谷南部
Dialogue: 1,1:15:13.02,1:15:14.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在老公园和鸟舍之间
Dialogue: 1,1:15:14.82,1:15:17.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 等等 你们在跟踪那头恐龙吗 - 是的
Dialogue: 1,1:15:17.78,1:15:20.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把装甲部队调过来 换上真枪实弹
Dialogue: 1,1:15:20.36,1:15:23.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,装甲部队已经登机了 他们开走了直升飞机
Dialogue: 1,1:15:23.40,1:15:25.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是谁开直升飞机
Dialogue: 1,1:15:27.21,1:15:30.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们曾在武装部队服役吗
Dialogue: 1,1:15:30.39,1:15:32.26,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,曾驻扎阿富汗 先生
Dialogue: 1,1:15:32.26,1:15:35.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们的上将曾亲临战场和你们一起战斗吗
Dialogue: 1,1:15:37.93,1:15:41.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,放心 我控制住了
Dialogue: 1,1:15:42.78,1:15:45.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们发现目标了 陀螺谷南部
Dialogue: 1,1:15:45.52,1:15:46.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,请前往交火
Dialogue: 1,1:15:46.91,1:15:48.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,打起精神来 兄弟们
Dialogue: 1,1:15:49.69,1:15:51.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,打起精神来
Dialogue: 1,1:15:59.02,1:16:01.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,10点钟方向 鸟舍旁边
Dialogue: 1,1:16:22.11,1:16:24.61,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 不 不
Dialogue: 1,1:16:24.61,1:16:27.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,看来狐狸进了鸡笼了
Dialogue: 1,1:16:44.60,1:16:47.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,拉高 拉高 快 快
Dialogue: 1,1:17:20.85,1:17:23.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,鸟舍出现了一个缺口
Dialogue: 1,1:17:43.09,1:17:45.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快进树林 快 快
Dialogue: 1,1:18:10.38,1:18:11.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这下好了
Dialogue: 1,1:18:12.58,1:18:14.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们安全了
Dialogue: 1,1:18:23.62,1:18:26.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快 快 快
Dialogue: 1,1:18:27.13,1:18:28.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快
Dialogue: 1,1:18:31.95,1:18:33.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿
Dialogue: 1,1:18:33.07,1:18:36.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 救命 - 快开门 让我们进去
Dialogue: 1,1:18:36.10,1:18:38.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快开门 - 快点
Dialogue: 1,1:18:38.54,1:18:40.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,第一次遇见这种情况
Dialogue: 1,1:18:40.50,1:18:42.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快开门
Dialogue: 1,1:18:42.13,1:18:44.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快开门 - 让我们进去
Dialogue: 1,1:18:52.85,1:18:56.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,鸟舍工作人员请注意 围场出现缺口
Dialogue: 1,1:18:56.82,1:18:58.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: 1,1:18:58.11,1:18:59.93,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱尔 我们在监控上看到你的外甥了
Dialogue: 1,1:18:59.95,1:19:01.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们刚从西门进来
Dialogue: 1,1:19:01.38,1:19:02.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在就过去
Dialogue: 1,1:19:02.49,1:19:04.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 好的 待在那里
Dialogue: 1,1:19:04.78,1:19:07.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我这就过去 守着他们 哪儿也别去
Dialogue: 1,1:19:07.62,1:19:08.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿
Dialogue: 1,1:19:08.73,1:19:10.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快上来
Dialogue: 1,1:19:24.16,1:19:27.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,女士们先生们 由于围场故障
Dialogue: 1,1:19:27.48,1:19:30.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,请所有游客马上进入室内
Dialogue: 1,1:19:31.45,1:19:34.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,女士们先生们 由于围场故障
Dialogue: 1,1:19:34.43,1:19:37.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,请所有游客马上进入室内
Dialogue: 1,1:19:40.14,1:19:43.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,女士们先生们 由于围场故障
Dialogue: 1,1:19:43.10,1:19:45.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,请所有游客马上进入室内
Dialogue: 1,1:20:39.46,1:20:41.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,所有单位注意 请在木板路就位
Dialogue: 1,1:20:41.67,1:20:45.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,使用液体镇定剂 请勿使用弹药
Dialogue: 1,1:20:45.04,1:20:46.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱尔 快
Dialogue: 1,1:21:06.56,1:21:07.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,别跑了
Dialogue: 1,1:21:21.56,1:21:23.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,别傻站在那儿
Dialogue: 1,1:22:03.42,1:22:05.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快 快进屋
Dialogue: 1,1:22:22.22,1:22:23.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,扎克
Dialogue: 1,1:22:24.41,1:22:26.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,格雷
Dialogue: 1,1:22:29.72,1:22:31.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 克莱尔阿姨 - 快 快
Dialogue: 1,1:22:31.89,1:22:32.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱尔
Dialogue: 1,1:22:34.74,1:22:36.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不 注意
Dialogue: 1,1:23:02.02,1:23:03.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那是克莱尔阿姨吗
Dialogue: 1,1:23:23.57,1:23:26.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是他们 扎克
Dialogue: 1,1:23:26.66,1:23:28.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,格雷
Dialogue: 1,1:23:28.24,1:23:31.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 天啊 谢天谢地 怎么回事 这是怎么了
Dialogue: 1,1:23:31.48,1:23:32.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 1,1:23:32.64,1:23:36.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们跑哪儿去了 为什么不回来
Dialogue: 1,1:23:36.67,1:23:38.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我快担心死你们了 - 那是谁
Dialogue: 1,1:23:44.91,1:23:46.59,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我的同事
Dialogue: 1,1:23:47.60,1:23:48.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿
Dialogue: 1,1:23:48.48,1:23:52.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们得走了 - 好的 快来 快
Dialogue: 1,1:23:54.51,1:23:57.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 嘿 你们不能就这么大摇大摆走进来
Dialogue: 1,1:23:57.27,1:24:00.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,西蒙·马斯拉尼的死是场悲剧
Dialogue: 1,1:24:01.41,1:24:05.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,新的任务是防止更多人员伤亡
Dialogue: 1,1:24:05.17,1:24:06.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是谁
Dialogue: 1,1:24:06.71,1:24:08.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就等你问呢
Dialogue: 1,1:24:08.66,1:24:11.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们全部被解除职务了
Dialogue: 1,1:24:11.03,1:24:13.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,现在由新的团队接手
Dialogue: 1,1:24:32.31,1:24:34.23,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,劳瑞 我正在往你那里去
Dialogue: 1,1:24:34.23,1:24:35.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,别回来
Dialogue: 1,1:24:35.36,1:24:36.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,董事会刚刚给生物工程公司的
Dialogue: 1,1:24:36.88,1:24:39.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,安保部门指派了新的应急行动
Dialogue: 1,1:24:39.11,1:24:40.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一个叫什么霍斯金的人负责
Dialogue: 1,1:24:40.85,1:24:42.26,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他有一个疯狂的计划
Dialogue: 1,1:24:42.26,1:24:45.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,利用迅猛龙来围捕暴虐霸王龙
Dialogue: 1,1:24:45.20,1:24:47.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你说 "利用迅猛龙" 是什么意思
Dialogue: 1,1:24:47.17,1:24:49.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这狗娘养的
Dialogue: 1,1:24:50.43,1:24:51.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你不该爆粗口的
Dialogue: 1,1:24:51.80,1:24:55.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把孩子们带到安全的地方
Dialogue: 1,1:25:11.20,1:25:14.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好了 该死 快开车 - 开快点
Dialogue: 1,1:25:20.62,1:25:22.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这里一点也不安全
Dialogue: 1,1:25:22.50,1:25:23.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们能和你待在一起吗
Dialogue: 1,1:25:23.50,1:25:26.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会再离开你们半步了
Dialogue: 1,1:25:26.52,1:25:27.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不不 我们说的是他
Dialogue: 1,1:25:29.45,1:25:31.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 当然是他了
Dialogue: 1,1:25:58.33,1:26:00.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 看这里
Dialogue: 1,1:26:01.40,1:26:03.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,看着我
Dialogue: 1,1:26:03.48,1:26:04.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她想看哪里就看哪里
Dialogue: 1,1:26:04.84,1:26:09.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她一般看到的都是食物
Dialogue: 1,1:26:27.81,1:26:30.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,母鸡终于到了
Dialogue: 1,1:26:31.96,1:26:37.16,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,给我滚出这里 离我的恐龙远一点
Dialogue: 1,1:26:37.38,1:26:41.26,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,霍斯金 你盼着这种事发生 你这个狗娘养的
Dialogue: 1,1:26:41.26,1:26:42.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 天啊
Dialogue: 1,1:26:42.13,1:26:44.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在你能想通这个任务之前
Dialogue: 1,1:26:44.01,1:26:46.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你还想眼睁睁地看着多少人去送死
Dialogue: 1,1:26:46.84,1:26:48.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是任务
Dialogue: 1,1:26:48.15,1:26:49.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是实地测验
Dialogue: 1,1:26:49.48,1:26:52.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,现在已经上升到生物工程的层面了
Dialogue: 1,1:26:52.79,1:26:54.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 明天一早
Dialogue: 1,1:26:54.15,1:26:56.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就会有大型轮船抵达这里
Dialogue: 1,1:26:56.76,1:26:58.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,所有人都将安全撤离
Dialogue: 1,1:26:58.55,1:26:59.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你明天看到的新闻
Dialogue: 1,1:26:59.99,1:27:02.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,将会是你们拯救了多少条生命
Dialogue: 1,1:27:02.57,1:27:03.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不不 更好的是
Dialogue: 1,1:27:03.82,1:27:06.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你的恐龙拯救了多少条生命
Dialogue: 1,1:27:08.63,1:27:11.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她们从来没出去过 这太扯了
Dialogue: 1,1:27:11.58,1:27:13.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,开始行动吧
Dialogue: 1,1:27:14.36,1:27:15.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,已经这样决定了
Dialogue: 1,1:27:15.82,1:27:19.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,有没有你都一样
Dialogue: 1,1:27:22.84,1:27:25.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道她现在在第五区
Dialogue: 1,1:27:25.20,1:27:28.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这场游戏我们称之为躲猫猫 是气味演习
Dialogue: 1,1:27:28.19,1:27:30.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经和这些恐龙练习了上千遍
Dialogue: 1,1:27:30.38,1:27:34.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,当她们锁定目标 她们一定会锁定
Dialogue: 1,1:27:34.19,1:27:36.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,等待发动进攻
Dialogue: 1,1:27:36.05,1:27:39.23,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,迅猛龙是群聚猎人
Dialogue: 1,1:27:39.23,1:27:41.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她们会把猎物集中在攻击范围内
Dialogue: 1,1:27:41.74,1:27:43.28,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那时就是我们发动进攻的时候
Dialogue: 1,1:27:43.28,1:27:44.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一枪命中
Dialogue: 1,1:27:44.62,1:27:46.92,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,听我命令 尽全力攻击
Dialogue: 1,1:27:46.92,1:27:49.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只有一个目标 先生们
Dialogue: 1,1:27:49.09,1:27:51.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不要伤了我的迅猛龙
Dialogue: 1,1:27:51.99,1:27:53.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了
Dialogue: 1,1:27:54.10,1:27:55.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,放松 布鲁
Dialogue: 1,1:27:55.96,1:27:58.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,放轻松
Dialogue: 1,1:27:59.78,1:28:01.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,乖女孩
Dialogue: 1,1:28:03.65,1:28:05.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你吓不到我的
Dialogue: 1,1:28:05.46,1:28:06.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,欧文
Dialogue: 1,1:28:11.57,1:28:12.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她们安全吗
Dialogue: 1,1:28:13.75,1:28:15.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,当然不安全了
Dialogue: 1,1:28:15.98,1:28:17.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她们叫什么名字
Dialogue: 1,1:28:17.58,1:28:20.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那边那头是查理
Dialogue: 1,1:28:20.20,1:28:22.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那是艾蔻 这是德尔塔
Dialogue: 1,1:28:22.97,1:28:26.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这头叫布鲁 她是老二
Dialogue: 1,1:28:26.62,1:28:28.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那谁是老大
Dialogue: 1,1:28:28.15,1:28:30.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,站在你面前的就是 小子
Dialogue: 1,1:28:35.17,1:28:36.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,看见了吧
Dialogue: 1,1:28:36.04,1:28:37.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,绝对安全
Dialogue: 1,1:28:38.97,1:28:41.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 进去吧 快
Dialogue: 1,1:28:41.04,1:28:42.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,上去坐好
Dialogue: 1,1:28:45.00,1:28:48.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们需要我 我就在前面驾驶座
Dialogue: 1,1:28:48.09,1:28:49.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,打开那扇窗户就行
Dialogue: 1,1:28:49.81,1:28:51.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗
Dialogue: 1,1:28:52.09,1:28:53.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,系好安全带
Dialogue: 1,1:28:57.17,1:28:58.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 那你们就
Dialogue: 1,1:28:58.97,1:29:01.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,拉着手好了
Dialogue: 1,1:29:21.38,1:29:23.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,什么东西都进不来的 对吧
Dialogue: 1,1:29:26.51,1:29:27.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿
Dialogue: 1,1:29:29.81,1:29:32.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你还记得老房子里的鬼吗
Dialogue: 1,1:29:32.63,1:29:34.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就是车库里的那个
Dialogue: 1,1:29:35.91,1:29:37.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我保护了你 不是吗
Dialogue: 1,1:29:39.87,1:29:43.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你用一把尺子和一个纸盘子做了一把战斧
Dialogue: 1,1:29:43.81,1:29:48.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 看 只要我在你身边 没有什么能伤害你的 明白吗
Dialogue: 1,1:29:49.21,1:29:51.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但你又不能永远在我身边
Dialogue: 1,1:29:52.47,1:29:54.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这个嘛
Dialogue: 1,1:29:54.91,1:29:56.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿
Dialogue: 1,1:29:56.04,1:29:59.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是兄弟 好吗
Dialogue: 1,1:29:59.62,1:30:00.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们永远都是兄弟
Dialogue: 1,1:30:00.81,1:30:02.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,永远都会回到对方身边的
Dialogue: 1,1:30:05.60,1:30:07.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,无论发生什么
Dialogue: 1,1:30:08.16,1:30:09.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,无论发生什么吗
Dialogue: 1,1:30:09.55,1:30:11.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 1,1:30:33.51,1:30:34.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了
Dialogue: 1,1:30:47.91,1:30:48.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,出发吧
Dialogue: 1,1:32:00.84,1:32:02.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你男朋友真屌
Dialogue: 1,1:32:15.84,1:32:18.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,想象一下如果我们在托拉博拉（阿富汗）养这种宠物
Dialogue: 1,1:32:21.20,1:32:23.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你有录下来吗
Dialogue: 1,1:32:35.43,1:32:36.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她们减速了
Dialogue: 1,1:32:37.79,1:32:39.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她们有发现了
Dialogue: 1,1:32:57.73,1:33:00.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这样不行 不行 不行 少儿不宜
Dialogue: 1,1:33:00.56,1:33:01.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把窗户关好了
Dialogue: 1,1:33:37.96,1:33:39.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,情况不对
Dialogue: 1,1:33:40.65,1:33:42.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她们在交流
Dialogue: 1,1:33:49.12,1:33:52.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道他们为什么不告诉我们 它另一部分基因是什么了
Dialogue: 1,1:33:52.43,1:33:53.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 1,1:33:58.06,1:34:00.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,它也有迅猛龙的基因
Dialogue: 1,1:34:07.99,1:34:10.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在磨蹭什么 开火
Dialogue: 1,1:34:10.54,1:34:11.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,开火
Dialogue: 1,1:34:26.18,1:34:27.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 我的天啊
Dialogue: 1,1:34:39.07,1:34:40.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,注意正后方
Dialogue: 1,1:34:40.55,1:34:43.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,迅猛龙们有新老大了
Dialogue: 1,1:36:05.07,1:36:06.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快回到车里 快
Dialogue: 1,1:36:06.58,1:36:08.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,撤退
Dialogue: 1,1:36:30.59,1:36:31.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不
Dialogue: 1,1:36:31.35,1:36:32.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,布鲁
Dialogue: 1,1:36:46.45,1:36:47.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 天啊
Dialogue: 1,1:36:47.83,1:36:50.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,所有人都死了吗
Dialogue: 1,1:36:50.01,1:36:52.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 不 大家都很好
Dialogue: 1,1:36:52.88,1:36:53.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,别对他说谎
Dialogue: 1,1:36:53.90,1:36:56.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他很害怕 当人们害怕的时候 撒点谎也无伤大雅
Dialogue: 1,1:36:56.66,1:36:58.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我想回家
Dialogue: 1,1:36:58.06,1:37:00.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝 你会安全到家的 好吗 我保证
Dialogue: 1,1:37:00.24,1:37:01.93,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,明天你就能回家了
Dialogue: 1,1:37:01.93,1:37:05.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,而你妈妈永远也不会让我再见到你们了
Dialogue: 1,1:37:06.25,1:37:07.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快离开这里 快走
Dialogue: 1,1:37:12.45,1:37:13.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她们来了
Dialogue: 1,1:37:23.98,1:37:26.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在后面坐好了
Dialogue: 1,1:38:15.43,1:38:17.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快启动啊 - 我不知道怎么启动
Dialogue: 1,1:38:30.14,1:38:31.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们哥俩还好吗
Dialogue: 1,1:38:31.27,1:38:33.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 刚才那一幕你看到了吗
Dialogue: 1,1:38:33.64,1:38:35.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我等不及要告诉妈妈了
Dialogue: 1,1:38:35.76,1:38:39.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 不要 千万不要告诉你妈妈这事儿 永远不要
Dialogue: 1,1:38:42.02,1:38:43.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 欧文 - 欧文
Dialogue: 1,1:38:48.36,1:38:50.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须要躲进室内 跟我来
Dialogue: 1,1:38:56.16,1:38:59.34,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,劳瑞 我们往你那边去了 找架直升机来
Dialogue: 1,1:39:12.70,1:39:14.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,所有东西都要清点好
Dialogue: 1,1:39:15.60,1:39:17.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,启动所有备用发电机
Dialogue: 1,1:39:23.59,1:39:24.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你去哪儿了
Dialogue: 1,1:39:24.95,1:39:28.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,计划有变 任务进行得不顺利
Dialogue: 1,1:39:28.32,1:39:29.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我要带部队撤离了
Dialogue: 1,1:39:29.82,1:39:31.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,胚胎在这里很安全
Dialogue: 1,1:39:31.42,1:39:33.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,依靠发电机它们能存活八周
Dialogue: 1,1:39:33.73,1:39:37.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 你听好了 公园明天一早就会宣告破产了
Dialogue: 1,1:39:37.51,1:39:40.26,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我们的小计划要拿到部队里去尝试一下
Dialogue: 1,1:39:40.26,1:39:41.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不想让一群律师插手
Dialogue: 1,1:39:41.72,1:39:43.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这些他们根本不懂的东西
Dialogue: 1,1:39:43.06,1:39:45.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,明白了吗
Dialogue: 1,1:39:45.18,1:39:48.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 不说话我就当你是默认了
Dialogue: 1,1:39:50.66,1:39:54.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,女士们先生们 感谢你们的耐心等待
Dialogue: 1,1:39:54.52,1:39:58.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,下一班轮渡将在45分钟后离开
Dialogue: 1,1:39:58.55,1:40:01.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,如果您需要紧急医疗救护
Dialogue: 1,1:40:01.07,1:40:03.34,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,请到最近的健康服务站寻求帮助
Dialogue: 1,1:40:03.34,1:40:05.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你就是这么想的吗
Dialogue: 1,1:40:05.07,1:40:07.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 各位 我们的撤离点在东码头
Dialogue: 1,1:40:11.52,1:40:12.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿
Dialogue: 1,1:40:12.25,1:40:14.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们说我们得撤离了 有艘船在等着
Dialogue: 1,1:40:14.40,1:40:15.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你来吗
Dialogue: 1,1:40:23.96,1:40:25.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,得有人坚守阵地
Dialogue: 1,1:40:30.74,1:40:33.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我有男朋友了
Dialogue: 1,1:40:33.77,1:40:37.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你们真的 在一起了
Dialogue: 1,1:40:37.13,1:40:38.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是在一起了
Dialogue: 1,1:40:38.33,1:40:40.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那很好啊 可从来没听你提起过他
Dialogue: 1,1:40:40.79,1:40:41.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我一向公私分明
Dialogue: 1,1:40:41.90,1:40:43.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不 好吧
Dialogue: 1,1:40:43.47,1:40:46.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好吧 - 好的
Dialogue: 1,1:40:46.63,1:40:47.61,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 很好 - 很好
Dialogue: 1,1:40:47.61,1:40:48.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好吧 - 好吧
Dialogue: 1,1:40:48.58,1:40:50.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你会没事的 对吧 - 是的
Dialogue: 1,1:40:50.09,1:40:52.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 拜
Dialogue: 1,1:41:00.91,1:41:02.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,霍斯金在哪儿
Dialogue: 1,1:41:02.53,1:41:05.41,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他要我们把你和这些资产送到安全的地方
Dialogue: 1,1:41:05.41,1:41:07.34,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们的协议还是有效的对吧
Dialogue: 1,1:41:07.34,1:41:10.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不用担心 我们会好好照顾你的 出发了
Dialogue: 1,1:41:16.91,1:41:19.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,感谢各位光临侏罗纪世界
Dialogue: 1,1:41:19.66,1:41:21.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,希望您玩得愉快
Dialogue: 1,1:41:21.76,1:41:24.68,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不要忘了去礼品店哦 请记住
Dialogue: 1,1:41:24.68,1:41:28.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,玛格丽塔酒吧有饮品减价活动哦
Dialogue: 1,1:41:31.36,1:41:33.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快过来 快 进去
Dialogue: 1,1:41:41.21,1:41:43.28,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,去主控室 那边
Dialogue: 1,1:41:53.79,1:41:55.61,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们疏散了实验室
Dialogue: 1,1:42:36.41,1:42:37.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们在干什么
Dialogue: 1,1:42:37.60,1:42:40.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你还不够级别过问这事 宝贝
Dialogue: 1,1:42:41.78,1:42:43.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,亨利在哪儿
Dialogue: 1,1:42:44.33,1:42:46.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,吴博士是我们的人
Dialogue: 1,1:42:47.14,1:42:49.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那不是真正的恐龙
Dialogue: 1,1:42:50.05,1:42:51.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,当然不是了 小子
Dialogue: 1,1:42:53.44,1:42:57.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但总要有人确保这家公司有光明的钱途
Dialogue: 1,1:42:57.19,1:42:59.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,试想一下
Dialogue: 1,1:42:59.08,1:43:03.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这只恐龙 有体型
Dialogue: 1,1:43:03.51,1:43:04.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,又致命
Dialogue: 1,1:43:04.05,1:43:05.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,还聪明
Dialogue: 1,1:43:05.44,1:43:09.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,能躲过最先进的军队科技
Dialogue: 1,1:43:09.76,1:43:13.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一个不同于我们所见过的活武器
Dialogue: 1,1:43:13.10,1:43:18.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们不懂吗 数万年的进化 我们又从中学到了什么
Dialogue: 1,1:43:20.67,1:43:23.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,大自然就是上天赐予的礼物
Dialogue: 1,1:43:23.21,1:43:24.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 靠
Dialogue: 1,1:43:27.34,1:43:28.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,别激动
Dialogue: 1,1:43:29.96,1:43:31.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,别激动
Dialogue: 1,1:43:31.33,1:43:34.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,别激动 嘿 嘿
Dialogue: 1,1:43:36.76,1:43:39.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是同一战线的 不是吗 对吗
Dialogue: 1,1:43:41.96,1:43:43.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,放松
Dialogue: 1,1:43:44.17,1:43:45.77,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,放松
Dialogue: 1,1:43:45.77,1:43:48.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你是一伙的
Dialogue: 1,1:43:56.80,1:43:59.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不 孩子们 这边 快
Dialogue: 1,1:43:59.11,1:44:00.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 快
Dialogue: 1,1:44:36.02,1:44:37.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们就是这样捕猎的 对吗
Dialogue: 1,1:44:54.51,1:44:56.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,放松
Dialogue: 1,1:45:00.39,1:45:01.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,放松
Dialogue: 1,1:45:10.87,1:45:13.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样
Dialogue: 1,1:46:22.14,1:46:24.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,24颗 50颗
Dialogue: 1,1:46:25.33,1:46:26.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要更多
Dialogue: 1,1:46:28.05,1:46:28.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,更多什么
Dialogue: 1,1:46:28.96,1:46:32.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,牙齿 我们需要更多牙齿
Dialogue: 1,1:46:41.66,1:46:44.28,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 你们在这儿等着
Dialogue: 1,1:46:45.54,1:46:47.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,会没事的
Dialogue: 1,1:47:35.53,1:47:37.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,劳瑞 你还在吗
Dialogue: 1,1:47:37.55,1:47:39.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 你在哪儿
Dialogue: 1,1:47:39.00,1:47:41.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把9号围场的门打开
Dialogue: 1,1:47:41.80,1:47:43.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,9号围场
Dialogue: 1,1:47:44.65,1:47:45.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你开玩笑吧
Dialogue: 1,1:47:50.62,1:47:53.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,该死 劳瑞 一辈子哪怕像个男人一次 好吗
Dialogue: 1,1:47:53.99,1:47:56.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么非要对我人身攻击啊
Dialogue: 1,1:50:10.80,1:50:12.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快跑
Dialogue: 1,1:50:12.76,1:50:14.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快跑 快 快
Dialogue: 1,1:53:42.82,1:53:45.26,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 天啊 你们父母来了 他们来了
Dialogue: 1,1:53:46.40,1:53:48.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快来 快啊
Dialogue: 1,1:53:51.60,1:53:57.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们还好吗 哦 我的宝贝
Dialogue: 1,1:54:04.14,1:54:05.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,真对不起
Dialogue: 1,1:54:07.37,1:54:09.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 1,1:54:13.44,1:54:14.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快过来
Dialogue: 1,1:54:16.62,1:54:18.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝
Dialogue: 1,1:54:35.38,1:54:37.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们接下来做什么
Dialogue: 1,1:54:38.23,1:54:40.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,最好待在一起
Dialogue: 1,1:54:42.45,1:54:44.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,为了生存
Dialogue: 2,0:02:06.15,0:02:09.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Boys, let's do this!
Dialogue: 2,0:02:15.60,0:02:16.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Gray?
Dialogue: 2,0:02:16.97,0:02:19.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Honey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 2,0:02:19.20,0:02:21.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What is this here? Let's go.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:21.00,0:02:23.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, honey. Your flight's in two hours.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:23.35,0:02:26.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Dane County Airport is 36 minutes away, 60 with traffic.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:26.64,0:02:29.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How many minutes to get your little butt in the van?
Dialogue: 2,0:02:31.12,0:02:32.92,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How many of those?
Dialogue: 2,0:02:32.92,0:02:35.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Feed the monster under your bed? - Yes.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:38.12,0:02:40.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Call me every day...
Dialogue: 2,0:02:40.01,0:02:42.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and text me pics so I don't forget what you look like.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:42.87,0:02:44.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm only gonna be gone a week.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:44.64,0:02:45.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Zach.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:45.78,0:02:49.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're not going off to war here. Please.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:49.48,0:02:50.59,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:50.59,0:02:53.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- I will see you later. - I love you.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:54.62,0:02:56.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Bye, okay? - Bye.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:56.61,0:02:58.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you in, buddy?
Dialogue: 2,0:03:02.21,0:03:04.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I know it hurts, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:04.15,0:03:06.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 2,0:03:11.22,0:03:12.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Everything right on there?
Dialogue: 2,0:03:12.83,0:03:14.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so jealous.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:14.75,0:03:17.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're gonna have so much fun. I love you.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:17.96,0:03:19.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I love you, too.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:26.30,0:03:27.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, great.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:27.89,0:03:31.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, let's give these to your brother, okay?
Dialogue: 2,0:03:31.30,0:03:33.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You hold these, please. Can you hold these?
Dialogue: 2,0:03:33.87,0:03:36.28,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Honey, I need you to take care of these. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:36.28,0:03:37.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:37.03,0:03:39.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Alright. - Listen to your mother.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:39.00,0:03:40.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Take care of your brother. Answer your phone.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:40.90,0:03:43.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm serious. It's the green button.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:43.20,0:03:45.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,When you see my name, push it, okay?
Dialogue: 2,0:03:45.57,0:03:49.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And remember... something chases you, run.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:50.69,0:03:51.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:51.25,0:03:53.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- All right. - You're funny. Okay, let's go. Come on.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:53.91,0:03:54.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Bye, guys. - Bye.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:54.91,0:03:57.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- I miss you already. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:58.95,0:04:01.61,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,So much for our last family breakfast.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:02.54,0:04:05.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Why do you have to say things like that?
Dialogue: 2,0:04:06.34,0:04:08.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you call your sister?
Dialogue: 2,0:04:08.09,0:04:10.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Straight to voice-mail.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:10.58,0:04:12.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be fine.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:12.37,0:04:14.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,She handles 20,000 people a day, right?
Dialogue: 2,0:04:14.45,0:04:16.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,She can handle two more.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:20.68,0:04:22.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How big is the island?
Dialogue: 2,0:04:22.29,0:04:23.92,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Big.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:23.92,0:04:25.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,But how many pounds?
Dialogue: 2,0:04:25.86,0:04:27.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:30.77,0:04:33.59,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,When they first opened, they had 8 species.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:33.59,0:04:36.41,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Now they have 14 herbivores and 6 carnivores.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:36.41,0:04:38.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's 50 tons of food a week.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:57.70,0:05:01.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome to Isla Nublar, home of Jurassic World.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:01.82,0:05:04.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We hope you have a safe and enjoyable stay with us.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:07.39,0:05:08.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Where's Aunt Claire?
Dialogue: 2,0:05:31.39,0:05:33.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Those of you in the front of
Dialogue: 2,0:05:33.05,0:05:35.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,the train should be able to see our main gates.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:48.30,0:05:50.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Please obey all park rules.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:50.45,0:05:52.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Proper attire, including shoes and shirts,
Dialogue: 2,0:05:52.67,0:05:54.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,must be worn at all times.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:54.05,0:05:57.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Your aunt arranged to meet you at 1:00. Can he slow down?
Dialogue: 2,0:05:57.81,0:05:59.41,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Nope.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:59.41,0:06:01.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on!
Dialogue: 2,0:06:07.00,0:06:08.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Your aunt's got you VIP access...
Dialogue: 2,0:06:08.75,0:06:11.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,so you can get in all the rides without waiting in line.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:11.31,0:06:12.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:12.57,0:06:13.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Dude, she said we had to wait.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:13.79,0:06:15.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't wanna wait anymore.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:44.67,0:06:48.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hal Osterley, vice president. Jim Drucker, bad hair.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:48.31,0:06:50.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Erica Brand, deserves better.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:50.61,0:06:53.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hal, Jim, Erica. Hal, Jim, Erica.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:53.52,0:06:55.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And I am Claire.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:56.21,0:06:58.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Three minutes late.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:01.15,0:07:03.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome to Jurassic World.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:04.94,0:07:07.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,While year over year, revenue continues to climb...
Dialogue: 2,0:07:07.55,0:07:09.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,operating costs are higher than ever.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:09.81,0:07:13.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Our shareholders have been patient but let's be honest...
Dialogue: 2,0:07:13.39,0:07:16.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,no one is impressed by a dinosaur anymore.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:16.70,0:07:19.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,20 years ago, de-extinction was right up there with magic.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:19.80,0:07:21.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,These days, kids look at a
Dialogue: 2,0:07:21.40,0:07:24.28,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Stegosaurus like an elephant from the city zoo.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:24.29,0:07:27.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That doesn't mean asset development is falling behind.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:27.09,0:07:30.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Our DNA excavators discover new species every year.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:30.87,0:07:36.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,But consumers want them bigger, louder, more teeth.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:36.00,0:07:37.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The good news?
Dialogue: 2,0:07:37.61,0:07:38.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Our advances in gene
Dialogue: 2,0:07:38.73,0:07:41.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,splicing have opened up a whole new frontier.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:42.07,0:07:44.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We've learned more from genetics in the past decade...
Dialogue: 2,0:07:44.96,0:07:47.93,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,than a century of digging up bones.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:47.93,0:07:48.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,So...
Dialogue: 2,0:07:48.90,0:07:52.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,when you say you want to sponsor an attraction...
Dialogue: 2,0:07:52.87,0:07:54.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,what do you have in mind?
Dialogue: 2,0:07:56.00,0:07:57.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We want to be thrilled.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:57.55,0:07:59.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't we all?
Dialogue: 2,0:08:02.80,0:08:07.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The Indominus Rex. Our first genetically modified hybrid.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:07.80,0:08:10.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How did you get two different kinds of dinosaurs to, you know...
Dialogue: 2,0:08:11.93,0:08:15.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Indominus wasn't bred. She was designed.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:15.80,0:08:19.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,She will be 50 feet long when fully grown.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:19.83,0:08:21.34,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Bigger than the T. Rex.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:21.34,0:08:25.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Every time we've unveiled a new asset, attendance has spiked.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:25.83,0:08:27.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Global news coverage...
Dialogue: 2,0:08:27.47,0:08:29.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,celebrity visitors.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:29.27,0:08:31.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Eyes of the world.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:31.10,0:08:32.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,When will she be ready?
Dialogue: 2,0:08:34.53,0:08:36.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,She already is.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:50.21,0:08:51.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on!
Dialogue: 2,0:08:51.52,0:08:52.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Relax.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:53.76,0:08:54.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:54.42,0:08:55.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Dude, chill.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:00.45,0:09:02.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome to the Innovation Center,
Dialogue: 2,0:09:02.70,0:09:05.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,where technology meets prehistory.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:13.13,0:09:16.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,can go horn-to-tooth with the apex predators.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:16.45,0:09:20.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Literally meaning "Three-horned face" In Greek...
Dialogue: 2,0:09:20.05,0:09:22.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Triceratops is half as tall as T. Rex
Dialogue: 2,0:09:22.99,0:09:26.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,as one-hundred trillion tons of TNT.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:28.03,0:09:30.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,turn its head back to look over its shoulder...
Dialogue: 2,0:09:30.46,0:09:34.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,to better aim the swing of its dangerous tail.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:37.86,0:09:40.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Cytosine, guanine, adenine and thymine.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:40.19,0:09:41.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The same four things in everything that ever lived.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:41.84,0:09:43.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, don't wander off, all right?
Dialogue: 2,0:09:43.54,0:09:45.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Mom's not paying me for babysitting.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:46.77,0:09:48.92,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Gray, is that you?
Dialogue: 2,0:09:48.92,0:09:50.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Aunt Claire!
Dialogue: 2,0:09:50.38,0:09:52.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, yeah. No, I'm gonna have to go. My nephews are here.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:53.74,0:09:54.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hi.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:54.74,0:09:59.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my gosh, you're so sweet.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:59.81,0:10:01.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa, Zach.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:01.65,0:10:04.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Last time I saw you, you were like...
Dialogue: 2,0:10:04.22,0:10:05.61,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That must've been what?
Dialogue: 2,0:10:05.61,0:10:08.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Three, four years ago? - Seven.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:08.22,0:10:10.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Seven years, but, you know, close.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:11.61,0:10:14.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I see you already got your wristbands.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:14.49,0:10:16.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And this is for food.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:16.17,0:10:19.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And Zara here is going to take great care of you...
Dialogue: 2,0:10:19.00,0:10:20.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,until I'm done working tonight, okay?
Dialogue: 2,0:10:20.96,0:10:22.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're not coming with us?
Dialogue: 2,0:10:22.95,0:10:26.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I really wish that I could, but...
Dialogue: 2,0:10:26.06,0:10:29.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,tomorrow I can take you into the control room...
Dialogue: 2,0:10:29.83,0:10:31.92,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,show you behind the scenes and all of that.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:31.92,0:10:34.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's gonna be cool, right?
Dialogue: 2,0:10:35.98,0:10:41.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, so I will see you tonight at... 6:00.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:41.10,0:10:42.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, no, no. Don't forget you have the...
Dialogue: 2,0:10:42.64,0:10:44.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Right, of course. I will see you tonight at 8:00.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:44.75,0:10:46.68,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What time do you go to sleep?
Dialogue: 2,0:10:46.68,0:10:49.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Or do you go to sleep at different times?
Dialogue: 2,0:10:51.38,0:10:54.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, so, have fun...
Dialogue: 2,0:10:54.11,0:10:56.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and take very good care of them, okay?
Dialogue: 2,0:10:58.17,0:10:59.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. No, I'm here.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:03.68,0:11:07.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's those two juvenile Triceratops. They're going at it again.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:07.02,0:11:09.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Should I tranq them, or are you coming over to take care of this?
Dialogue: 2,0:11:09.91,0:11:12.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Go ahead and tranq them. - They're running.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:12.84,0:11:15.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- What's the live count? - 22,216.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:15.89,0:11:17.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Any incidents? - Yes.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:17.33,0:11:19.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Six kids in the Lost and Found...
Dialogue: 2,0:11:19.08,0:11:21.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,28 down with heatstroke...
Dialogue: 2,0:11:21.51,0:11:23.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Where did you get that?
Dialogue: 2,0:11:23.57,0:11:27.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, this? I got it on eBay. Yeah, it's pretty amazing.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:27.54,0:11:31.26,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I got it for $150 but the mint condition one goes for $300...
Dialogue: 2,0:11:31.26,0:11:32.92,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't occur to you maybe that's in poor taste?
Dialogue: 2,0:11:32.92,0:11:34.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The shirt? Yeah, no, it did.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:34.78,0:11:36.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I understand people died. It was terrible...
Dialogue: 2,0:11:36.71,0:11:40.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,but that first park was legit.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:40.15,0:11:41.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I have a lot of respect for it.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:41.42,0:11:43.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They didn't need these genetic hybrids.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:43.02,0:11:45.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They just needed dinosaurs, real dinosaurs.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:45.08,0:11:46.93,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, please don't wear it again.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:46.93,0:11:48.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I wasn't gonna.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:48.10,0:11:50.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Did you close the deal? - Looks like it.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:50.46,0:11:54.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Verizon Wireless presents the Indominus Rex.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:54.19,0:11:56.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That is so terrible.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:56.75,0:11:58.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Why not just go the distance,
Dialogue: 2,0:11:58.39,0:12:01.28,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and just let these corporations name the dinosaurs?
Dialogue: 2,0:12:01.28,0:12:02.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They've got all the ballparks.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:02.76,0:12:05.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Why stop there? - Why are the West Plains closed?
Dialogue: 2,0:12:05.36,0:12:07.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Another Pachy roaming outside his zone.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:07.13,0:12:08.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,But he's fully sedated and ready for relocation.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:08.98,0:12:11.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Pepsi-saurus or Tostito-don.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:11.36,0:12:13.28,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Security said the invisible fences were a
Dialogue: 2,0:12:13.29,0:12:15.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,no-fail. That is the second time this month.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:15.35,0:12:18.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The Pachys short out their implants when they butt heads.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:18.46,0:12:20.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How much longer until they get it out of there?
Dialogue: 2,0:12:20.47,0:12:23.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He just got five milligrams of carfentanil.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:23.22,0:12:27.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, he's very stoned. So why don't we show a little sympathy?
Dialogue: 2,0:12:27.51,0:12:30.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I mean you do understand these are actual animals, right?
Dialogue: 2,0:12:31.31,0:12:32.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Clean up your workspace.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:32.69,0:12:35.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's chaotic.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:35.22,0:12:38.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I like to think of it as a living system.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:38.73,0:12:40.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Just enough stability...
Dialogue: 2,0:12:40.37,0:12:43.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,to keep it from collapsing into anarchy.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:49.93,0:12:53.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Inbound chopper, Jurassic 1. ETA, 5 minutes.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:17.06,0:13:18.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Claire.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:18.64,0:13:22.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Masrani. You are flying.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:22.06,0:13:23.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I got my license.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:23.67,0:13:26.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Two more. - Well, two more days.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:26.05,0:13:27.23,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Okay. - So...
Dialogue: 2,0:13:27.23,0:13:29.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- how's my park doing? - Great.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:29.39,0:13:31.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We're up two and a half percent over last year.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:31.73,0:13:33.59,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,A bit lower than our initial prediction.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:33.59,0:13:35.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, no, no, how's it doing?
Dialogue: 2,0:13:35.36,0:13:38.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Are the guests having fun? Are the animals enjoying life?
Dialogue: 2,0:13:38.32,0:13:42.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, guest satisfaction is steady in the low 90s.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:42.52,0:13:46.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We don't have a way to measure the animals' emotional experience.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:46.73,0:13:49.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure you do. You can see in their eyes.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:49.18,0:13:50.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 2,0:13:50.57,0:13:51.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:52.47,0:13:56.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Now show me my new dinosaur.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:03.83,0:14:04.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Got it.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:05.62,0:14:06.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Got it.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:07.21,0:14:08.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Got it.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:18.87,0:14:20.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my!
Dialogue: 2,0:14:23.10,0:14:24.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You look tense, Claire.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:25.73,0:14:28.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe you should just focus on the controls.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:28.69,0:14:30.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The key to a happy life is
Dialogue: 2,0:14:30.87,0:14:34.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,to accept you are never actually in control.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:34.56,0:14:36.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Bird!
Dialogue: 2,0:14:39.57,0:14:40.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You should spend a day at the beach.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:40.95,0:14:42.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get some sun.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:43.31,0:14:44.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Right, so...
Dialogue: 2,0:14:44.37,0:14:48.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Marketing thought we could offset some of the costs by...
Dialogue: 2,0:14:48.27,0:14:50.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Enough about cost.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:50.05,0:14:52.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,John Hammond entrusted me with his dying wish...
Dialogue: 2,0:14:52.89,0:14:54.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and not once did he mention profits.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:54.79,0:14:57.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Spare no expense, He used to say.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:57.14,0:14:58.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I appreciate that, but the
Dialogue: 2,0:14:58.75,0:15:01.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,reality of operating a theme park requires...
Dialogue: 2,0:15:01.54,0:15:03.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't forget why we built this place, Claire.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:03.39,0:15:05.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Jurassic World exists to
Dialogue: 2,0:15:05.22,0:15:08.34,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,remind us how very small we are. How new.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:08.34,0:15:09.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't put a price on that.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:09.97,0:15:13.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, please, we're flying.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:13.70,0:15:16.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Breathe.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:43.66,0:15:45.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Is he okay?
Dialogue: 2,0:15:45.06,0:15:47.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Are you okay? - He's just being dramatic.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:47.24,0:15:49.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you still building?
Dialogue: 2,0:15:50.85,0:15:52.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We planned to open in May...
Dialogue: 2,0:15:52.89,0:15:56.34,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,but Asset Containment insisted we build the walls up higher.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:56.34,0:15:58.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's bigger than expected.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:04.12,0:16:05.92,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a good sign.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:08.10,0:16:10.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We hit a few speed bumps early on.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:10.94,0:16:14.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It began to anticipate where the food would come from.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:14.21,0:16:16.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,One of the handlers nearly lost an arm.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:16.35,0:16:17.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The others threatened to
Dialogue: 2,0:16:17.64,0:16:19.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,quit if I couldn't guarantee their safety.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:20.74,0:16:22.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,She's intelligent then?
Dialogue: 2,0:16:22.91,0:16:24.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,For a dinosaur.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:24.63,0:16:26.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And that?
Dialogue: 2,0:16:31.32,0:16:33.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It tried to break the glass.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:33.83,0:16:36.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I like her spirit.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:57.57,0:17:01.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's white. You never told me it was white.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:06.49,0:17:08.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Think it will scare the kids?
Dialogue: 2,0:17:08.90,0:17:11.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The kids?
Dialogue: 2,0:17:12.36,0:17:15.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This will give the parents nightmares.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:15.10,0:17:18.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that good?
Dialogue: 2,0:17:19.16,0:17:21.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's fantastic.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:25.60,0:17:27.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Can she see us?
Dialogue: 2,0:17:27.25,0:17:31.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They say it can sense thermal radiation. Like snakes.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:32.67,0:17:34.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought there were two of them.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:34.71,0:17:38.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,There was a sibling in case this one didn't survive infancy.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:38.50,0:17:39.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Where's the sibling?
Dialogue: 2,0:17:39.82,0:17:42.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,She ate it.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:49.93,0:17:53.23,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,So, the paddock is quite safe, then?
Dialogue: 2,0:17:53.67,0:17:57.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We have the best structural engineers in the world.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:57.58,0:17:59.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, so did Hammond.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:02.26,0:18:04.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,There's an American Navy man here.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:04.58,0:18:07.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Part of a research program one of my companies is running.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:07.42,0:18:09.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Owen Grady.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:10.08,0:18:11.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I know who he is.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:11.85,0:18:13.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,His animals often try to escape.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:13.81,0:18:17.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They are smart. He has to be smarter.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:17.09,0:18:18.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He only thinks he's smarter.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:19.78,0:18:22.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I want you to bring him in.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:22.56,0:18:24.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Let him inspect the paddock.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:25.62,0:18:28.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe he sees something we can't.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:44.90,0:18:45.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold!
Dialogue: 2,0:18:53.30,0:18:54.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 2,0:18:58.52,0:18:59.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 2,0:18:59.63,0:19:02.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Eyes on me.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:02.33,0:19:03.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Blue?
Dialogue: 2,0:19:03.73,0:19:05.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Blue!
Dialogue: 2,0:19:05.25,0:19:07.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Watch it.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:07.51,0:19:09.28,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Charlie. Hey!
Dialogue: 2,0:19:09.28,0:19:10.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't give me that shit!
Dialogue: 2,0:19:11.51,0:19:12.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Delta!
Dialogue: 2,0:19:12.65,0:19:14.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Lock it up!
Dialogue: 2,0:19:14.94,0:19:16.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Good!
Dialogue: 2,0:19:17.00,0:19:19.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And we're moving!
Dialogue: 2,0:19:26.13,0:19:27.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold!
Dialogue: 2,0:19:28.65,0:19:32.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's good. That is damn good.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:33.07,0:19:34.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Very good!
Dialogue: 2,0:19:34.22,0:19:36.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,See, Charlie, that's what you get!
Dialogue: 2,0:19:37.26,0:19:38.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Echo, there you go!
Dialogue: 2,0:19:38.80,0:19:39.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Delta!
Dialogue: 2,0:19:41.61,0:19:43.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Blue?
Dialogue: 2,0:19:45.71,0:19:47.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This one's for you.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:50.54,0:19:51.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold!
Dialogue: 2,0:19:53.06,0:19:54.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Eyes up!
Dialogue: 2,0:19:57.71,0:19:59.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Go.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:05.73,0:20:07.28,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You finally did it, man.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:07.28,0:20:08.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Owen.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:10.57,0:20:13.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I was starting to think I hired the wrong guys...
Dialogue: 2,0:20:13.31,0:20:15.26,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,but, damn, you got them eating out of your palm.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:15.27,0:20:17.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You came on a good day. It's not usually a happy ending.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:17.48,0:20:19.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that why you're not sending in your reports?
Dialogue: 2,0:20:19.40,0:20:20.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We've been busy.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:20.60,0:20:23.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Not too busy to cash your paychecks.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:23.98,0:20:25.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you need, buddy?
Dialogue: 2,0:20:26.13,0:20:27.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,A field test.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:27.36,0:20:32.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey. I've just seen they can respond to commands.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:32.14,0:20:34.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We need to take the research and get it on its feet.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:34.62,0:20:35.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,These are wild animals, Hoskins.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:35.81,0:20:37.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Trust me, you don't want them in the field.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:37.39,0:20:40.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I just saw a bond. A real bond.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:40.64,0:20:42.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Between man and beast.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:42.54,0:20:45.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- You're in my way. - Come on. We're the same.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:45.52,0:20:46.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We're dogs of war.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:46.98,0:20:50.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We know that the military needs to reduce casualties.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:50.20,0:20:52.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Some people think that robots are the future.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:52.45,0:20:54.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Look, nature gave us the most
Dialogue: 2,0:20:54.47,0:20:57.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,effective killing machines 75 million years ago.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:57.80,0:21:00.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And now we know they can take orders.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:00.08,0:21:02.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We finally make progress and that's the first thing he says?
Dialogue: 2,0:21:02.95,0:21:04.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Make a weapon?
Dialogue: 2,0:21:04.33,0:21:05.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Shit.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:06.39,0:21:07.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, gents.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:07.60,0:21:09.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's grown-up time.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:09.35,0:21:13.61,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Drones can't search tunnels and caves. And they're hackable.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:13.61,0:21:15.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The minute a real war breaks out,
Dialogue: 2,0:21:15.22,0:21:17.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,all that fancy tech is gonna go dark.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:17.24,0:21:20.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,But that tech's not gonna eat them if they forget to feed it.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:21.17,0:21:23.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Look at these creatures.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:23.06,0:21:25.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They've got millions of years of instinct in
Dialogue: 2,0:21:25.31,0:21:27.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,their cells, instinct that we can program.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:27.46,0:21:30.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Their loyalty cannot be bought.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:31.27,0:21:32.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,These guys are gonna run
Dialogue: 2,0:21:32.52,0:21:34.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,straight into the enemy's teeth and eat them...
Dialogue: 2,0:21:34.98,0:21:36.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,belt buckle and all.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:36.27,0:21:39.34,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What if they decide they wanna be in control?
Dialogue: 2,0:21:39.34,0:21:42.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Then we remind them who is. We terminate the rogues.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:42.27,0:21:44.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Promote only loyal bloodlines.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:45.65,0:21:48.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What? What's so funny?
Dialogue: 2,0:21:51.96,0:21:54.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You come here and you don't learn anything about these animal,
Dialogue: 2,0:21:54.25,0:21:55.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,except what you want to know.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:57.09,0:21:59.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You made them and now you think you own them.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:59.38,0:22:01.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We do own them.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:02.45,0:22:04.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Extinct animals have no rights.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:05.09,0:22:06.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're not extinct anymore, Hoskins.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:06.71,0:22:09.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Exactly. We're sitting on a goldmine.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:09.82,0:22:13.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And Masrani is using it to stock a petting zoo.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:13.86,0:22:15.61,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He just wants to teach people some humility.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:15.61,0:22:16.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He doesn't make weapons.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:16.56,0:22:19.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You think that the 8th richest man in the world...
Dialogue: 2,0:22:19.35,0:22:23.41,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,is only into oil, telecom and family fun parks?
Dialogue: 2,0:22:23.70,0:22:25.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He's so diversified, he doesn't even know what he owns.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:25.88,0:22:28.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How long has INGEN been practicing this pitch?
Dialogue: 2,0:22:28.12,0:22:30.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Since the day we hired you out of the Navy.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:30.87,0:22:32.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You knew the end game.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:32.29,0:22:36.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,These animals can replace thousands of boots on the ground.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:36.14,0:22:37.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How many lives would that save?
Dialogue: 2,0:22:40.37,0:22:42.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,War is part of nature.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:43.53,0:22:46.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Look around, Owen. Every living thing in this jungle...
Dialogue: 2,0:22:46.84,0:22:49.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,is trying to murder the other.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:49.46,0:22:52.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Mother Nature's way of testing her creations.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:52.67,0:22:54.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Refining the pecking order.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:54.51,0:22:58.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,War is a struggle. Struggle breeds greatness.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:59.08,0:23:00.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Without that...
Dialogue: 2,0:23:00.53,0:23:03.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,we end up with places like this, charge seven bucks a soda.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:04.22,0:23:06.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you hear yourself when you talk?
Dialogue: 2,0:23:09.96,0:23:14.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is gonna happen. With or without you boys.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:14.11,0:23:15.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Progress always wins, man.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:15.96,0:23:18.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe progress should lose for once.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:20.49,0:23:21.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Pig loose!
Dialogue: 2,0:23:22.38,0:23:23.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Pig loose!
Dialogue: 2,0:23:42.01,0:23:43.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Owen, no!
Dialogue: 2,0:23:46.55,0:23:48.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, hold your fire!
Dialogue: 2,0:23:49.99,0:23:52.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold your fire. Do not fire.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:55.18,0:23:58.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Put 12 amps in these animals, they're never gonna trust me again.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:00.05,0:24:02.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Blue, stand down.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:03.83,0:24:05.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Stand down.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:06.38,0:24:08.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Hey! What did I just say?
Dialogue: 2,0:24:10.19,0:24:12.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Delta, I see you. Back up!
Dialogue: 2,0:24:14.54,0:24:15.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:15.83,0:24:17.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Good.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:17.49,0:24:19.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Good.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:19.99,0:24:21.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Charlie?
Dialogue: 2,0:24:22.00,0:24:24.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Stay right there.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:24.99,0:24:25.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Good.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:28.84,0:24:29.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Close the gate.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:29.90,0:24:31.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 2,0:24:31.67,0:24:33.26,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Just trust me.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:33.27,0:24:34.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Close the gate!
Dialogue: 2,0:24:52.59,0:24:53.59,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:58.39,0:25:00.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're the new guy, right?
Dialogue: 2,0:25:00.40,0:25:01.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:01.88,0:25:04.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You ever wonder why there was a job opening?
Dialogue: 2,0:25:06.56,0:25:09.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't ever turn your back to the cage.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:53.84,0:25:55.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Lift me up. I can't see!
Dialogue: 2,0:25:55.78,0:25:58.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not Dad. And you're not five.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:58.48,0:26:02.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I can still ride the Triceratops. I'm 47-and-a-half inches.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:03.31,0:26:04.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This place is for little kids.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:06.21,0:26:07.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:07.34,0:26:09.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Wanna go on the spinning dinosaur eggs? - Nope.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:10.60,0:26:12.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Cover up your dork pouch.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:13.33,0:26:14.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's my wedding.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:14.42,0:26:16.77,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, Alec's not having a bachelor party.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:16.77,0:26:18.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Because all his friends are animals.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:18.92,0:26:19.92,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Scatter.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:19.92,0:26:22.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- What? - Go. Run. Go! Go, go!
Dialogue: 2,0:26:43.13,0:26:45.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The next T. Rex feeding will begin in 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:45.52,0:26:47.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- T. Rex! Come on, man! - Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:47.83,0:26:48.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 2,0:26:48.72,0:26:50.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Parents be aware, this
Dialogue: 2,0:26:50.24,0:26:53.28,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,show may be disturbing for smaller children.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:04.45,0:27:05.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Mom.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:05.56,0:27:08.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You were supposed to call me when you landed.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:08.38,0:27:10.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you having fun?
Dialogue: 2,0:27:10.76,0:27:12.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:13.82,0:27:16.93,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Aunt Claire gave us passes so we don't have to wait in line.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:16.93,0:27:18.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, she's not with you?
Dialogue: 2,0:27:23.83,0:27:25.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Karen!
Dialogue: 2,0:27:25.83,0:27:27.61,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hi, Claire. How's it going?
Dialogue: 2,0:27:27.61,0:27:30.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, everything's great. The boys are having fun.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:30.52,0:27:33.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone's... Yeah, everyone's good.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:33.10,0:27:35.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Really? Because I just hung up with Zach and
Dialogue: 2,0:27:35.10,0:27:36.92,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,he said that you weren't even with them.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:36.92,0:27:42.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, look. Today turned out to be a really bad day for me.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:42.73,0:27:46.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're in great hands. They're with my assistant.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:46.11,0:27:49.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,She's British, so, like, they invented nannies.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:52.64,0:27:53.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, are you crying?
Dialogue: 2,0:27:55.21,0:27:58.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This was supposed to be a family weekend, Claire.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:58.10,0:28:00.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You haven't seen the boys in forever.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:00.03,0:28:02.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And I know how Zach will treat Gray if they're by themselves.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:02.32,0:28:03.92,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And he can just be so mean.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:03.92,0:28:06.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:06.78,0:28:10.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Tomorrow, I'm gonna spend the entire day with them.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:10.21,0:28:11.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to take off work
Dialogue: 2,0:28:11.43,0:28:13.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and I will not leave their side. I promise.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:13.43,0:28:17.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, a promise tomorrow is worth a lot less than trying today.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:17.82,0:28:19.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're using Mom's lines now?
Dialogue: 2,0:28:19.90,0:28:22.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my God. I am using Mom's lines.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:23.04,0:28:25.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, but you know I have to tell you they work.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:25.03,0:28:26.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll see when you have kids.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:26.64,0:28:27.93,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, "If."
Dialogue: 2,0:28:27.93,0:28:31.61,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,When. It's worth it.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:31.61,0:28:33.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye, Mom.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:35.36,0:28:37.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:54.34,0:28:55.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What do they want now?
Dialogue: 2,0:28:56.17,0:28:57.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Grady?
Dialogue: 2,0:28:58.27,0:29:02.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I need you to come take a look at something.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:03.35,0:29:05.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you calling me Mr. Grady?
Dialogue: 2,0:29:05.76,0:29:07.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Owen.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:08.90,0:29:11.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- If you're not too busy. - I'm pretty busy.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:11.40,0:29:13.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We have an attraction.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:13.14,0:29:14.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not what you said the last time I saw you.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:14.98,0:29:17.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm talking about the dinosaurs, Mr. Grady.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:17.63,0:29:18.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Owen.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:18.52,0:29:21.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,A new species we've... made.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:23.84,0:29:26.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You just went and made a new dinosaur?
Dialogue: 2,0:29:26.87,0:29:29.59,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it's kind of what we do here.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:30.34,0:29:32.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The exhibit opens to the public in three weeks.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:32.78,0:29:35.93,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Masrani wanted me to consult with you.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:35.93,0:29:41.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You wanna consult here or... in my bungalow?
Dialogue: 2,0:29:41.01,0:29:42.93,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not funny.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:44.08,0:29:45.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,A little funny.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:45.38,0:29:48.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We'd like you to evaluate the paddock for vulnerabilities.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:48.40,0:29:49.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Why me?
Dialogue: 2,0:29:49.49,0:29:52.28,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess Mr. Masrani thinks,
Dialogue: 2,0:29:52.28,0:29:56.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,since you're able to control the Raptors...
Dialogue: 2,0:29:56.72,0:29:58.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's all about control with you.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:58.29,0:30:01.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't control the Raptors. It's a relationship.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:01.04,0:30:03.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's based on mutual respect.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:05.05,0:30:06.92,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's why you and I never had a second date.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:06.92,0:30:10.77,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me? I never wanted a second date.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:10.78,0:30:12.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Who prints out an itinerary for a night out?
Dialogue: 2,0:30:12.50,0:30:14.16,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm an organized person.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:14.16,0:30:16.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of a diet doesn't allow tequila?
Dialogue: 2,0:30:16.35,0:30:17.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All of them, actually.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:17.98,0:30:22.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And what kind of a man shows up to a date in board shorts?
Dialogue: 2,0:30:22.32,0:30:24.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Central America. It's hot.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:24.05,0:30:27.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, okay. Can we just focus on the asset, please?
Dialogue: 2,0:30:27.72,0:30:28.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The asset?
Dialogue: 2,0:30:30.12,0:30:33.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Look, I get it. You're in charge out here.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:33.09,0:30:34.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You gotta make a lot of tough decisions.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:34.56,0:30:36.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's probably easier to pretend
Dialogue: 2,0:30:36.01,0:30:38.26,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,these animals are just numbers on a spreadsheet.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:38.26,0:30:41.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,But they're not. They're alive.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:41.45,0:30:44.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fully aware they're alive.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:44.06,0:30:45.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You might have made them in a test tube,
Dialogue: 2,0:30:45.85,0:30:46.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,but they don't know that.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:46.96,0:30:48.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're thinking, "I gotta eat."
Dialogue: 2,0:30:48.92,0:30:53.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I gotta hunt. I gotta...
Dialogue: 2,0:30:54.48,0:30:59.34,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You can relate to at least one of those things. Right?
Dialogue: 2,0:31:02.72,0:31:04.28,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be in the car.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:07.91,0:31:11.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You might want to change your shirt.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:11.28,0:31:14.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're very sensitive to smell.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:23.77,0:31:25.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The Mosasaurus was thought
Dialogue: 2,0:31:25.06,0:31:27.41,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,to have hunted near the surface of the water...
Dialogue: 2,0:31:27.41,0:31:30.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,where it preyed on anything it could sink its teeth into.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:30.87,0:31:36.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Including turtles, large fish, even smaller Mosasaurus.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:36.32,0:31:38.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, folks, let's see if
Dialogue: 2,0:31:38.12,0:31:41.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,she's still hungry after already eating today.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:41.44,0:31:43.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,She's a little shy, so be
Dialogue: 2,0:31:43.39,0:31:46.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,nice and give her a hand when she comes out.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:46.82,0:31:47.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Zach!
Dialogue: 2,0:31:47.82,0:31:49.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The Mosasaurus!
Dialogue: 2,0:32:00.87,0:32:03.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my God! That was awesome!
Dialogue: 2,0:32:06.80,0:32:08.68,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on tight. We're gonna
Dialogue: 2,0:32:08.68,0:32:12.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,give you an even closer look at our Mosasaurus.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:25.86,0:32:27.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It had 88 teeth!
Dialogue: 2,0:32:28.91,0:32:32.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Wanna see something else cool? - Yeah!
Dialogue: 2,0:32:39.43,0:32:42.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We've been pre-booking tickets for months.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:42.53,0:32:45.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The park needs a new attraction every few years...
Dialogue: 2,0:32:45.65,0:32:47.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,in order to reinvigorate the public's interest.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:47.85,0:32:49.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Kind of like the space program.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:49.50,0:32:53.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Corporate felt genetic modification would up the wow factor.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:53.49,0:32:55.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're dinosaurs. Wow enough.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:55.54,0:32:57.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Not according to our focus groups.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:57.91,0:33:00.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The Indominus Rex makes us relevant again.
Dialogue: 2,0:33:00.84,0:33:02.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The Indominus Rex?
Dialogue: 2,0:33:02.63,0:33:05.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We needed something scary and easy to pronounce.
Dialogue: 2,0:33:05.63,0:33:09.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You should hear a four-year-old try to say "Archaeornithomimus."
Dialogue: 2,0:33:09.76,0:33:11.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You should hear you try to say it.
Dialogue: 2,0:33:16.85,0:33:18.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,So what's this thing made of?
Dialogue: 2,0:33:19.35,0:33:24.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The base genome is a T. Rex. The rest is classified.
Dialogue: 2,0:33:24.36,0:33:27.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You made a new dinosaur but you don't even know what it is?
Dialogue: 2,0:33:27.04,0:33:29.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The lab delivers us finished assets,
Dialogue: 2,0:33:29.02,0:33:30.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and we show them to the public.
Dialogue: 2,0:33:30.73,0:33:32.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Can we drop a steer, please?
Dialogue: 2,0:33:32.66,0:33:34.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How long has the animal been in here?
Dialogue: 2,0:33:34.69,0:33:36.92,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All its life.
Dialogue: 2,0:33:36.92,0:33:39.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Never seen anything outside of these walls?
Dialogue: 2,0:33:39.29,0:33:40.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We can't exactly walk it.
Dialogue: 2,0:33:40.66,0:33:42.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And you feed it with that?
Dialogue: 2,0:33:47.20,0:33:49.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 2,0:33:49.13,0:33:52.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Animals raised in isolation aren't always the most functional.
Dialogue: 2,0:33:53.41,0:33:55.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Your Raptors are born in captivity.
Dialogue: 2,0:33:55.88,0:33:59.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,With siblings. They learn social skills.
Dialogue: 2,0:33:59.65,0:34:01.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And I imprint on them when they're born.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:01.79,0:34:03.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,There's trust.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:03.06,0:34:04.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The only positive
Dialogue: 2,0:34:04.06,0:34:06.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,relationship this animal has is with that crane.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:08.08,0:34:09.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,At least she knows that means food.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:09.94,0:34:12.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,So, she needs a friend.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:12.71,0:34:15.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We should schedule play-dates? That sort of thing?
Dialogue: 2,0:34:16.50,0:34:18.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Probably not a good idea.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:21.45,0:34:24.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Where is it? - Is it in the basement?
Dialogue: 2,0:34:24.94,0:34:28.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Is there a downstairs? Maybe it's in the rec room.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:28.52,0:34:30.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It was just here. We were just here.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:39.29,0:34:41.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:43.74,0:34:45.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:47.90,0:34:49.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,These doors haven't been opened in weeks.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:51.42,0:34:53.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Were those claw marks always there?
Dialogue: 2,0:34:59.21,0:35:00.93,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you think it...
Dialogue: 2,0:35:03.08,0:35:05.26,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:05.26,0:35:07.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,She has an implant in her back.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:07.43,0:35:09.92,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I can track it from the control room.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:19.71,0:35:21.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We have an asset out of containment.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:21.90,0:35:24.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Put ACU on alert. This is not a drill.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:24.80,0:35:27.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Even though I didn't meet him until I was 13...
Dialogue: 2,0:35:27.73,0:35:30.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I definitely consider Carl to be more of a dad than my real dad.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:35.64,0:35:37.61,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Yeah, hello? - Lowery.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:37.61,0:35:39.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get me coordinates on the Indominus.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:40.65,0:35:41.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, yeah.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:43.21,0:35:44.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm doing it right now.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:08.49,0:36:10.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That wall is 40 feet high.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:10.40,0:36:12.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you really think she could have climbed out?
Dialogue: 2,0:36:13.61,0:36:14.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It depends.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:14.96,0:36:16.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,On what?
Dialogue: 2,0:36:16.75,0:36:20.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of dinosaur they cooked up in that lab.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:22.16,0:36:23.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, what the hell?
Dialogue: 2,0:36:24.55,0:36:26.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's in the cage.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:26.13,0:36:28.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, that's impossible. I was just there.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:28.49,0:36:31.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Claire, I'm telling you, she's in the cage.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:32.07,0:36:33.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:33.20,0:36:34.93,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,There are people in there.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:36.78,0:36:38.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get them out of there now.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:38.98,0:36:40.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Now!
Dialogue: 2,0:36:40.56,0:36:42.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Paddock 11, this is Control.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:42.13,0:36:44.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You need to evacuate the containment area.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:44.49,0:36:45.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Paddock 11.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:45.90,0:36:48.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Paddock 11, do you copy?
Dialogue: 2,0:36:48.85,0:36:50.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, what's the problem?
Dialogue: 2,0:36:50.14,0:36:51.77,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's in the cage! It's in there with you!
Dialogue: 2,0:36:51.77,0:36:53.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Go!
Dialogue: 2,0:37:22.30,0:37:23.41,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Close the door.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:23.41,0:37:25.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We can't lock him in there with that thing.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:25.02,0:37:25.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Close it now!
Dialogue: 2,0:37:25.58,0:37:28.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Somebody talk to me! What is happening?
Dialogue: 2,0:37:29.81,0:37:30.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Shit!
Dialogue: 2,0:39:41.25,0:39:45.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone remain calm.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:52.81,0:39:54.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The implant will shock it
Dialogue: 2,0:39:54.31,0:39:56.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,if it gets too close to a perimeter fence.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:56.83,0:39:58.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. It's moving really fast.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:58.38,0:40:00.41,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Control. Put out a park-wide alert.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:00.43,0:40:01.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hang up that damn phone, please.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:01.98,0:40:04.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I'm getting new information. Everything's fine.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:04.98,0:40:06.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Let Asset Containment capture it quietly.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:06.76,0:40:10.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The very existence of this park is predicated on our ability...
Dialogue: 2,0:40:10.63,0:40:12.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,to handle incidents like this.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:12.56,0:40:14.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It was an eventuality, okay?
Dialogue: 2,0:40:14.54,0:40:16.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You should put that in the brochure.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:16.22,0:40:19.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Eventually, one of these things will eat somebody.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:19.99,0:40:23.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That paddock is 4 miles from the closest attraction.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:23.29,0:40:25.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,ACU can handle this. No one else is gonna get...
Dialogue: 2,0:40:25.95,0:40:27.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Eaten?
Dialogue: 2,0:40:43.24,0:40:45.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How fast can they run?
Dialogue: 2,0:40:45.96,0:40:47.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,40.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:47.29,0:40:49.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,50 when they're hungry.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:50.86,0:40:53.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You ever open them up, see what they can do?
Dialogue: 2,0:40:53.78,0:40:54.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:54.89,0:40:56.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 2,0:40:56.81,0:40:59.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That got me. It got me.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:59.72,0:41:02.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you think? Want to take one home?
Dialogue: 2,0:41:02.45,0:41:03.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, don't joke.
Dialogue: 2,0:41:03.53,0:41:05.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,When I was your age...
Dialogue: 2,0:41:06.05,0:41:08.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I rescued a wolf pup.
Dialogue: 2,0:41:08.30,0:41:12.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It was, like, two months old. It could barely walk.
Dialogue: 2,0:41:12.32,0:41:15.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It used to sleep by my bed.
Dialogue: 2,0:41:15.01,0:41:16.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Watch over me.
Dialogue: 2,0:41:17.59,0:41:20.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,My wife, she came at me with a steak knife.
Dialogue: 2,0:41:20.88,0:41:23.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It took a chunk out of her arm.
Dialogue: 2,0:41:23.84,0:41:24.93,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you put him down?
Dialogue: 2,0:41:25.90,0:41:27.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hell, no.
Dialogue: 2,0:41:28.08,0:41:31.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We had an unshakeable bond, you know?
Dialogue: 2,0:41:31.49,0:41:33.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Just like you and...
Dialogue: 2,0:41:34.79,0:41:36.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What's his name?
Dialogue: 2,0:41:36.59,0:41:39.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Delta. And she's a girl.
Dialogue: 2,0:41:39.52,0:41:41.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Can I...
Dialogue: 2,0:41:52.84,0:41:54.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 2,0:42:01.71,0:42:03.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Code 19!
Dialogue: 2,0:42:03.45,0:42:06.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- That's the new one! - They said we lost two guys!
Dialogue: 2,0:42:06.15,0:42:07.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- What's a Code 19? - That's Indominus!
Dialogue: 2,0:42:07.66,0:42:08.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Asset out of containment.
Dialogue: 2,0:42:08.66,0:42:12.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,These people, they never learn.
Dialogue: 2,0:42:14.28,0:42:15.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're gonna learn all
Dialogue: 2,0:42:15.55,0:42:17.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,kinds of things about their new asset now.
Dialogue: 2,0:42:20.39,0:42:25.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it's me. We might have an opportunity here.
Dialogue: 2,0:42:44.09,0:42:45.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You guys been here before?
Dialogue: 2,0:42:48.00,0:42:49.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,If Mom and Dad get divorced,
Dialogue: 2,0:42:49.29,0:42:51.61,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,will one of us be with Mom and the other with Dad?
Dialogue: 2,0:42:51.61,0:42:54.16,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What? Why would you say that?
Dialogue: 2,0:42:54.16,0:42:55.16,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Because they are.
Dialogue: 2,0:42:55.16,0:42:58.23,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, they're not getting... They're not getting divorced.
Dialogue: 2,0:42:59.34,0:43:01.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Look, you haven't been around long enough.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:01.02,0:43:02.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They've always been that way.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:02.63,0:43:04.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They get mail from two different lawyers.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:04.63,0:43:06.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That doesn't mean anything.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:06.06,0:43:08.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I googled. They're divorce lawyers.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:11.58,0:43:12.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, whatever.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:12.94,0:43:15.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You know what? It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:15.11,0:43:18.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay? I'm gonna be gone in two years anyway.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:18.01,0:43:20.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All my friends' parents are divorced.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:22.39,0:43:24.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, knock it off.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:25.10,0:43:26.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're gonna cry?
Dialogue: 2,0:43:27.87,0:43:29.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Look, you're gonna get two of everything.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:29.96,0:43:32.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Right? Two birthdays, two Thanksgivings. Two...
Dialogue: 2,0:43:32.78,0:43:35.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want two of everything.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:35.47,0:43:37.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, well, it's not up to you.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:38.57,0:43:40.92,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,There's a point you have to grow up.
Dialogue: 2,0:44:11.60,0:44:12.92,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I need to see a badge.
Dialogue: 2,0:44:12.92,0:44:14.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sir, sir. I need to see a badge.
Dialogue: 2,0:44:14.03,0:44:15.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell happened out there?
Dialogue: 2,0:44:15.18,0:44:15.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sir!
Dialogue: 2,0:44:15.69,0:44:17.77,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,There are thermal cameras all over that paddock.
Dialogue: 2,0:44:17.77,0:44:19.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,She did not just disappear!
Dialogue: 2,0:44:20.97,0:44:23.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It must have been some kind of a technical malfunction.
Dialogue: 2,0:44:23.65,0:44:24.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Were you not watching?
Dialogue: 2,0:44:24.94,0:44:26.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,She marked up that wall as a distraction.
Dialogue: 2,0:44:26.95,0:44:28.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,She wanted us to think she escaped!
Dialogue: 2,0:44:28.66,0:44:31.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on. We are talking about an animal here.
Dialogue: 2,0:44:31.02,0:44:34.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- A highly intelligent animal. - 400 meters to the beacon.
Dialogue: 2,0:44:58.34,0:45:00.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're going after her with non-lethals.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:00.32,0:45:03.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We have $26 million invested in that asset.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:03.06,0:45:04.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We can't just kill it.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:04.46,0:45:05.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Those men are gonna die.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:05.87,0:45:07.26,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,300 meters to the beacon.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:07.26,0:45:09.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Call this mission off right now. - They're right on top of it.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:09.64,0:45:13.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Call it off right now. - You are not in control here!
Dialogue: 2,0:45:44.72,0:45:46.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Blood's not clotted yet.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:46.69,0:45:47.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's close.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:48.98,0:45:50.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What is that?
Dialogue: 2,0:45:51.86,0:45:54.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's her tracking implant. She clawed it out.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:54.62,0:45:56.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How would it know to do that?
Dialogue: 2,0:45:57.67,0:46:00.26,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,She remembered where they put it in.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:33.25,0:46:35.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It can camouflage!
Dialogue: 2,0:47:31.51,0:47:33.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Evacuate the island.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:34.68,0:47:36.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We'd never reopen.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:36.20,0:47:40.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You made a genetic hybrid, raised it in captivity.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:40.84,0:47:43.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,She is seeing all of this for the first time.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:43.51,0:47:46.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,She does not even know what she is.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:46.22,0:47:49.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,She will kill everything that moves.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:49.04,0:47:52.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you think the animal is contemplating its own existence?
Dialogue: 2,0:47:52.30,0:47:54.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,She is learning where she fits in the food chain...
Dialogue: 2,0:47:54.29,0:47:56.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and I'm not sure you want her to figure that out.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:56.30,0:47:57.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, Asset Containment can
Dialogue: 2,0:47:57.73,0:48:00.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,use live ammunition in an emergency situation.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:00.25,0:48:02.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You have an M134 in your armory.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:02.10,0:48:04.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Put it on a chopper and smoke this thing!
Dialogue: 2,0:48:04.46,0:48:05.61,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We have families here. I'm not
Dialogue: 2,0:48:05.61,0:48:07.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,gonna turn this place into some kind of a war zone.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:07.55,0:48:08.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You already have.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:08.79,0:48:10.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Grady, if you're not gonna help,
Dialogue: 2,0:48:10.50,0:48:12.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,there's no reason for you to be in here.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:19.35,0:48:22.28,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I would have a word with your people in the lab.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:22.28,0:48:26.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That thing out there... that's no dinosaur.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:44.92,0:48:48.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to close everything north of the resort.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:48.95,0:48:52.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is a Phase One, real world. Bring everyone in.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:52.70,0:48:55.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is a Phase One, real world. I repeat, this is a Phase One.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:55.74,0:48:57.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Bring everyone back in.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:01.29,0:49:02.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The soft tissue is preserved
Dialogue: 2,0:49:02.30,0:49:03.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,because the iron in the dinosaur's blood...
Dialogue: 2,0:49:03.86,0:49:07.26,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,generates free radicals, and those are highly reactive.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:07.26,0:49:10.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The proteins and the cell membranes get all mixed up...
Dialogue: 2,0:49:10.21,0:49:12.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and act as a natural preservative.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:12.42,0:49:14.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,DNA can survive for millennia that way.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:14.98,0:49:17.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if the amber mines dry up, they'll still have bones...
Dialogue: 2,0:49:17.80,0:49:18.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:21.13,0:49:24.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you think's gonna happen from you just staring at them?
Dialogue: 2,0:49:26.98,0:49:29.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Thanks, man. - You're welcome.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:32.14,0:49:33.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Enjoy the ride.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:37.45,0:49:39.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Pregnant women and those who suffer from motion sickness...
Dialogue: 2,0:49:39.86,0:49:42.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,should consult with a doctor before riding this ride.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:54.59,0:49:55.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Enjoy the ride.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:58.34,0:49:59.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello?
Dialogue: 2,0:50:02.59,0:50:04.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 2,0:50:05.88,0:50:08.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, folks. The ride is closed.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:09.88,0:50:13.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone needs to proceed to the monorail and exit towards the...
Dialogue: 2,0:50:16.80,0:50:19.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, guys, I just work here.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:19.12,0:50:23.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Due to technical difficulties, all our exhibits are now closed.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:31.13,0:50:32.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You know that I'm not at
Dialogue: 2,0:50:32.48,0:50:34.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,liberty to reveal the asset's genetic makeup.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:35.54,0:50:38.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Modified animals are known to be unpredictable.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:39.15,0:50:40.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's killed people, Henry.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:41.96,0:50:43.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's unfortunate.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:43.67,0:50:47.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What purpose could we have for a dinosaur that can camouflage?
Dialogue: 2,0:50:47.83,0:50:49.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Cuttlefish genes were added
Dialogue: 2,0:50:49.54,0:50:52.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,to help her withstand an accelerated growth rate.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:52.64,0:50:54.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Cuttlefish have chromatophores
Dialogue: 2,0:50:54.64,0:50:57.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,that allow the skin to change color.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:57.61,0:51:00.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It hid from thermal technology.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:00.92,0:51:02.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 2,0:51:02.05,0:51:03.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How is that possible?
Dialogue: 2,0:51:07.83,0:51:10.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Tree frogs can modulate their infrared output.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:10.60,0:51:12.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We used strands from their
Dialogue: 2,0:51:12.26,0:51:14.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,DNA to adapt her to a tropical climate.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:14.74,0:51:16.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,But I never imagined...
Dialogue: 2,0:51:16.73,0:51:18.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Who authorized you to do this?
Dialogue: 2,0:51:19.45,0:51:20.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You did.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:20.71,0:51:22.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Bigger.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:22.22,0:51:23.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Scarier.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:23.88,0:51:29.41,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Cooler I believe is the word that you used in your memo.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:29.41,0:51:33.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You cannot have an animal with exaggerated predator features...
Dialogue: 2,0:51:33.12,0:51:35.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,without the corresponding behavioral traits.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:35.90,0:51:37.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What you're doing here...
Dialogue: 2,0:51:37.35,0:51:40.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What you have done...
Dialogue: 2,0:51:41.53,0:51:43.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The Board will shut down this park,
Dialogue: 2,0:51:43.22,0:51:45.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,seize your work, everything you've built.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:46.83,0:51:48.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And Hammond won't be there to protect you this time.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:48.70,0:51:52.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All of this exists because of me.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:53.26,0:51:56.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,If I don't innovate, somebody else will.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:57.32,0:52:01.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You are to cease all activities here immediately.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:02.11,0:52:05.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You are acting like we are engaged in some kind of mad science.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:05.86,0:52:09.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,But we are doing what we have done from the beginning.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:09.72,0:52:13.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing in Jurassic World is natural.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:13.09,0:52:14.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We have always filled gaps
Dialogue: 2,0:52:14.56,0:52:17.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,in the genome with the DNA of other animals.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:17.06,0:52:19.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And, if their genetic code was pure,
Dialogue: 2,0:52:19.08,0:52:21.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,many of them would look quite different.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:21.32,0:52:23.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,But you didn't ask for reality. You asked for more teeth.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:23.91,0:52:26.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- I never asked for a monster! - "Monster" Is a relative term.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:26.78,0:52:29.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,To a canary, a cat is a monster.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:29.52,0:52:33.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We're just used to being the cat.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:37.32,0:52:39.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, there. I'm Jimmy Fallon.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:39.13,0:52:40.77,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome aboard the Gyrosphere,
Dialogue: 2,0:52:40.77,0:52:43.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,an amazing machine made possible by science.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:43.18,0:52:44.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Your safety is our main concern.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:44.85,0:52:47.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Which is why you're behind our invisible barrier system...
Dialogue: 2,0:52:47.10,0:52:50.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,which protects you from things like Dilophosaurus venom.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:50.91,0:52:54.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,One drop of this can paralyze you, so watch out.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:54.76,0:52:57.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Is this real? It is?
Dialogue: 2,0:52:57.76,0:52:59.59,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And for added protection, each
Dialogue: 2,0:52:59.59,0:53:02.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,vehicle is surrounded by aluminum oxynitride glass.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:02.71,0:53:05.77,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,So tough, it can stop a .50-caliber bullet.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:08.93,0:53:12.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The Gyroscopic technology will keep you upright at all times...
Dialogue: 2,0:53:12.10,0:53:13.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Where are they?
Dialogue: 2,0:53:13.29,0:53:14.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,So you've got nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:14.72,0:53:15.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:51.49,0:53:55.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Due to technical difficulties all our exhibits are now closed.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:55.72,0:53:59.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Please disembark all rides and return to the resort.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:01.90,0:54:04.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, we can stay out a couple more minutes.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:05.24,0:54:07.26,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,But they said it was closed.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:07.26,0:54:09.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Aunt Claire gave us special wristbands, right?
Dialogue: 2,0:54:09.56,0:54:10.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We're VIP, dude.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:11.82,0:54:14.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on. It'll be fun.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:45.04,0:54:46.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Hello? - Zara.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:47.27,0:54:49.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I need you to bring the boys back to the hotel right away.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:49.46,0:54:51.59,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know... I've been looking everywhere for them.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:52.10,0:54:53.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Slow down. I can't hear you.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:53.74,0:54:55.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Zach and Gray, they've run off.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:55.08,0:54:56.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They what?
Dialogue: 2,0:55:00.98,0:55:02.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Claire.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:03.39,0:55:05.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Zach, thank God. Is Gray with you?
Dialogue: 2,0:55:05.98,0:55:09.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't really hear you. We're in the hamster ball.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:09.64,0:55:11.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Zach, listen to me.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:11.55,0:55:12.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I need you to...
Dialogue: 2,0:55:13.77,0:55:15.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello?
Dialogue: 2,0:55:15.62,0:55:17.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Hello? - Zach?
Dialogue: 2,0:55:21.70,0:55:23.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Are there any Gyrospheres left in the Valley?
Dialogue: 2,0:55:23.64,0:55:25.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, they're all accounted for. It's my job.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:25.38,0:55:25.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 2,0:55:25.98,0:55:27.68,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,There's one in the field.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:28.52,0:55:30.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Send a team of rangers, bring them in.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:30.60,0:55:32.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Security, we need a search and rescue in the Valley.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:32.58,0:55:34.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's gonna be a while. We've got our hands full out here.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:35.48,0:55:37.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, no, no. There are two guests missing!
Dialogue: 2,0:55:37.85,0:55:39.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You need to make this your top priority!
Dialogue: 2,0:55:39.77,0:55:41.16,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Just do it, man. - There's a lot of guests missing.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:41.16,0:55:42.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We're doing the best we can.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:42.17,0:55:44.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Fine. I'll do it myself.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:44.08,0:55:45.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, do you think I'm the
Dialogue: 2,0:55:45.42,0:55:47.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,one you need to be worried about right now?
Dialogue: 2,0:55:47.72,0:55:48.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Back off!
Dialogue: 2,0:55:56.77,0:55:58.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What happened here?
Dialogue: 2,0:56:01.66,0:56:03.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Dude.
Dialogue: 2,0:56:03.12,0:56:04.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Off-road.
Dialogue: 2,0:56:04.91,0:56:07.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,But they told us to go back.
Dialogue: 2,0:56:07.13,0:56:08.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just worried you're not
Dialogue: 2,0:56:08.94,0:56:11.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,getting the full Jurassic World experience.
Dialogue: 2,0:56:27.44,0:56:28.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Claire!
Dialogue: 2,0:56:29.73,0:56:31.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- I need you. - Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:56:31.75,0:56:32.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I need your help.
Dialogue: 2,0:56:32.75,0:56:34.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,My nephews, they're out in the Valley.
Dialogue: 2,0:56:34.31,0:56:35.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Please, if anything happens to them...
Dialogue: 2,0:56:37.97,0:56:38.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How old?
Dialogue: 2,0:56:38.81,0:56:44.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The older one, he's high school age. The younger one, he's...
Dialogue: 2,0:56:44.91,0:56:48.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- He's a few years... - You don't know how old your nephews are?
Dialogue: 2,0:56:49.67,0:56:51.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, no. Bad idea, bad idea.
Dialogue: 2,0:56:51.72,0:56:54.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Great idea. - No! We're gonna get arrested.
Dialogue: 2,0:56:54.84,0:56:55.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They'll shave our heads, and
Dialogue: 2,0:56:55.97,0:56:57.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,we're gonna have to make root beer in the toilet.
Dialogue: 2,0:56:57.95,0:56:59.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 2,0:57:00.83,0:57:01.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,There.
Dialogue: 2,0:57:01.75,0:57:04.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You see? I told you.
Dialogue: 2,0:57:06.38,0:57:08.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're welcome. Up close and personal...
Dialogue: 2,0:57:08.24,0:57:11.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,with four dinosauruses.
Dialogue: 2,0:57:11.96,0:57:13.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Ankylosaurus.
Dialogue: 2,0:57:13.66,0:57:17.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We shouldn't be here. And there's five dinosaurs.
Dialogue: 2,0:57:17.76,0:57:20.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you supposed to be a genius or something? Look.
Dialogue: 2,0:57:20.81,0:57:23.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,One, two, three...
Dialogue: 2,0:57:23.30,0:57:24.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,four.
Dialogue: 2,0:57:24.35,0:57:26.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Five.
Dialogue: 2,0:57:37.82,0:57:40.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Go, go, go! - Shit!
Dialogue: 2,0:57:48.38,0:57:49.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold it together, man!
Dialogue: 2,0:57:57.75,0:58:00.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Drive! Drive! Go!
Dialogue: 2,0:58:31.04,0:58:33.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We're safe in here, right?
Dialogue: 2,0:58:33.08,0:58:34.68,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. They're totally safe.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:39.49,0:58:40.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:41.08,0:58:43.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Pick up, pick up, pick up, pick up.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:50.46,0:58:51.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Zach.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:51.57,0:58:52.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I almost got it.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:52.57,0:58:53.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Zach? - Yeah?
Dialogue: 2,0:58:53.95,0:58:54.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Look.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:54.95,0:58:55.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 2,0:59:50.77,0:59:52.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Go! Go!
Dialogue: 2,1:00:15.11,1:00:16.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- We're gonna have to jump. - I can't.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:16.37,1:00:20.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you ready? One, two... Come on!
Dialogue: 2,1:01:09.72,1:01:11.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You jumped.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:31.37,1:01:32.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Stay in the car.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:03.96,1:02:04.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hi.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:04.98,1:02:07.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hi.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:20.16,1:02:22.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I know, I know.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:32.73,1:02:34.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:34.36,1:02:36.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, girl.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:53.03,1:02:53.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:53.79,1:02:56.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, okay, okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:56.03,1:02:58.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:51.45,1:03:52.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It didn't eat them.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:54.05,1:03:56.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's killing for sport.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:03.68,1:04:05.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Units on standby, ready for go.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:05.62,1:04:07.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Good. Hold off on that live feed.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:07.48,1:04:09.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We've got an evolving situation here.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:09.55,1:04:11.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Did they give you the green light yet?
Dialogue: 2,1:04:11.73,1:04:12.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They will.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:19.26,1:04:22.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Owen, we have a situation here.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:29.02,1:04:30.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, there. I'm Jimmy Fallon.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:30.64,1:04:32.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome aboard the Gyrosphere,
Dialogue: 2,1:04:32.18,1:04:34.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,an amazing machine made possible by science.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:35.60,1:04:38.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, there. Your safety is our main concern.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:38.08,1:04:40.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Now just relax and enjoy the ride.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:00.69,1:05:03.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, no, no. No.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:06.46,1:05:07.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:08.11,1:05:09.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They made it out.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:22.52,1:05:24.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my God, they jumped.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:24.19,1:05:25.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Brave kids.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:25.76,1:05:28.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Zach! Gray!
Dialogue: 2,1:05:29.27,1:05:31.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, I am not one of your damn animals.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:31.51,1:05:34.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, those kids are still alive...
Dialogue: 2,1:05:34.21,1:05:38.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,but you and I will not be if you continue to scream like that.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:39.29,1:05:42.23,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,So, you can pick up their scent,
Dialogue: 2,1:05:42.23,1:05:45.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,can't you? Track their footprints?
Dialogue: 2,1:05:45.36,1:05:47.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I was with the Navy, not the Navajo.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:47.12,1:05:49.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,So then what should we do? What do you suggest we do?
Dialogue: 2,1:05:49.21,1:05:50.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You get back. I'll find them.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:50.99,1:05:52.59,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, we'll find them.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:52.59,1:05:54.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll last two minutes in there.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:54.98,1:05:57.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Less, in those ridiculous shoes.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:11.27,1:06:12.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 2,1:06:13.95,1:06:16.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It means I'm ready to go.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:17.06,1:06:18.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:19.31,1:06:21.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's get one thing straight. I'm in charge out here.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:21.50,1:06:23.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You do everything I say, exactly as I say it.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:23.40,1:06:25.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Excuse me? - Just relax.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:27.32,1:06:29.92,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's just like taking a stroll through the woods.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:31.30,1:06:33.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,65 million years ago.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:09.06,1:07:10.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Stay here.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:00.69,1:08:01.92,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:37.71,1:08:39.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You still have those matches?
Dialogue: 2,1:08:41.73,1:08:42.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:07.15,1:09:08.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Gray!
Dialogue: 2,1:09:38.77,1:09:42.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,1992 Jeep Wrangler Sahara, Sand Beige.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:45.27,1:09:48.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You remember when we fixed up Grandpa's old Malibu, right?
Dialogue: 2,1:09:48.48,1:09:50.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:59.00,1:10:01.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Every time this thing kills, it moves further south.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:01.91,1:10:02.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's headed right for the park.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:02.87,1:10:04.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Why would she come here?
Dialogue: 2,1:10:04.44,1:10:06.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,She can sense thermal radiation.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:06.32,1:10:09.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Our emergency measures just put all the warm bodies in one place.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:11.61,1:10:13.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Sir... - INGEN.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:14.90,1:10:15.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hoskins.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:16.80,1:10:18.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I know who you are.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:18.24,1:10:20.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Then you know why I'm here.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:22.27,1:10:23.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I've been working for two
Dialogue: 2,1:10:23.27,1:10:24.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,years on an application for those Raptors.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:26.24,1:10:29.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They can hunt and kill that creature.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:29.20,1:10:31.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,But your program was to test their intelligence.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:31.65,1:10:33.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it was. And we did.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:33.22,1:10:36.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And in the process, we learned something.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:36.91,1:10:38.68,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They follow orders.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:39.34,1:10:40.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You see, the solution to
Dialogue: 2,1:10:40.82,1:10:43.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,your crisis is standing right in front of you.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:44.37,1:10:46.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me be as clear as I can.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:46.75,1:10:51.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No Velociraptors are going to be set loose on this island.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:51.75,1:10:52.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:52.91,1:10:54.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're out of your mind!
Dialogue: 2,1:10:54.62,1:10:56.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you going to do with all these people?
Dialogue: 2,1:10:56.04,1:10:57.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You got 20,000 people here. What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 2,1:10:57.94,1:10:59.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They have no place to go.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:00.42,1:11:02.26,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That thing is a killing machine!
Dialogue: 2,1:11:04.98,1:11:07.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And it will not stop.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:08.69,1:11:09.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:09.66,1:11:11.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I intend to personally look into your project...
Dialogue: 2,1:11:11.95,1:11:13.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,to determine its viability
Dialogue: 2,1:11:13.74,1:11:16.77,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,within the moral principles of this company.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:19.35,1:11:21.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, boss.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:22.49,1:11:24.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What's your next move?
Dialogue: 2,1:11:33.79,1:11:35.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sir, I can't get a hold of your instructor.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:35.74,1:11:39.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Never mind. He's likely caught up in the evacuation.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:39.24,1:11:41.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're sure there's nobody else who can fly a helicopter?
Dialogue: 2,1:11:42.97,1:11:45.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We don't need anyone else.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:07.54,1:12:08.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You think it's out there?
Dialogue: 2,1:12:14.12,1:12:16.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, I know for a fact
Dialogue: 2,1:12:16.17,1:12:19.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,it is definitely not out there, all right?
Dialogue: 2,1:12:19.63,1:12:21.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We're totally safe.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:21.52,1:12:24.41,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Here, go take this.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:26.11,1:12:27.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're stronger than me.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:39.00,1:12:41.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All right. Turn it over.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:44.55,1:12:45.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It works!
Dialogue: 2,1:12:52.07,1:12:53.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you failed your driver's test.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:53.81,1:12:56.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, only the driving part.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:14.04,1:13:15.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This one of theirs?
Dialogue: 2,1:13:15.71,1:13:16.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:17.79,1:13:20.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That road goes straight back to the park.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:22.98,1:13:25.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How did they even get one of these things started?
Dialogue: 2,1:15:09.17,1:15:11.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Lowery, we found her.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:11.47,1:15:13.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,South of the Gyrosphere Valley,
Dialogue: 2,1:15:13.02,1:15:14.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,between the old park and the Aviary.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:14.82,1:15:17.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Wait, are you following the dinosaur? - Yes.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:17.78,1:15:20.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get ACU out here. Real guns this time.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:20.36,1:15:23.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,ACU is airborne. They took the helicopter.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:23.40,1:15:25.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Who's flying it?
Dialogue: 2,1:15:27.21,1:15:30.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you boys serve in the Armed Forces?
Dialogue: 2,1:15:30.39,1:15:32.26,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Afghanistan, sir.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:32.26,1:15:35.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Did your general ever fly into battle with you?
Dialogue: 2,1:15:37.93,1:15:41.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Got it! Got it.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:42.78,1:15:45.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We have eyes on the target, south of the Aviary.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:45.52,1:15:46.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Proceed and engage.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:46.91,1:15:48.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on! Look alive, boys!
Dialogue: 2,1:15:49.69,1:15:51.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Look alive!
Dialogue: 2,1:15:59.02,1:16:01.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,10 o'clock! By the birdcage!
Dialogue: 2,1:16:22.11,1:16:24.61,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, no, no! No, no, no.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:24.61,1:16:27.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like the fox got in the henhouse.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:44.60,1:16:47.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Pull up! Pull up! Up, up, up!
Dialogue: 2,1:17:20.85,1:17:23.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We have a breach in the Aviary.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:43.09,1:17:45.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Trees, the trees! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 2,1:18:10.38,1:18:11.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, that's it.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:12.58,1:18:14.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We're safe now.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:23.62,1:18:26.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Go, go, go! Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 2,1:18:27.13,1:18:28.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 2,1:18:31.95,1:18:33.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 2,1:18:33.07,1:18:36.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Help! - Open the gate! Let us in!
Dialogue: 2,1:18:36.10,1:18:38.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Open it up! - Come on!
Dialogue: 2,1:18:38.54,1:18:40.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's a first.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:40.50,1:18:42.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Open the gate!
Dialogue: 2,1:18:42.13,1:18:44.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Open the gate! - Let us in!
Dialogue: 2,1:18:52.85,1:18:56.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Attention Aviary employees, there has been a containment breach.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:56.82,1:18:58.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello?
Dialogue: 2,1:18:58.11,1:18:59.93,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Claire, we spotted the boys on surveillance.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:59.95,1:19:01.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're approaching the west gate.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:01.38,1:19:02.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm headed there now.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:02.49,1:19:04.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, okay. Stay right there.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:04.78,1:19:07.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm on my way. Stay right with them.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:07.62,1:19:08.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 2,1:19:08.73,1:19:10.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get on!
Dialogue: 2,1:19:24.16,1:19:27.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Ladies and gentlemen, due to a containment anomaly...
Dialogue: 2,1:19:27.48,1:19:30.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,all guests must take shelter immediately.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:31.45,1:19:34.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Ladies and gentlemen, due to a containment anomaly...
Dialogue: 2,1:19:34.43,1:19:37.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,all guests must take shelter immediately.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:40.14,1:19:43.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Ladies and gentlemen, due to a containment anomaly...
Dialogue: 2,1:19:43.10,1:19:45.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,all guests must take shelter immediately.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:39.46,1:20:41.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All units, take position on boardwalk.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:41.67,1:20:45.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Use liquid tranquilizers. Do not fire live ammunition.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:45.04,1:20:46.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Claire, come on!
Dialogue: 2,1:21:06.56,1:21:07.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop running!
Dialogue: 2,1:21:21.56,1:21:23.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't just stand there!
Dialogue: 2,1:22:03.42,1:22:05.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Go! Get inside now!
Dialogue: 2,1:22:22.22,1:22:23.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Zach!
Dialogue: 2,1:22:24.41,1:22:26.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Gray!
Dialogue: 2,1:22:29.72,1:22:31.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Aunt Claire! - Go, go!
Dialogue: 2,1:22:31.89,1:22:32.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Claire!
Dialogue: 2,1:22:34.74,1:22:36.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No! Hold your...
Dialogue: 2,1:23:02.02,1:23:03.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that Aunt Claire?
Dialogue: 2,1:23:23.57,1:23:26.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's them! Zach!
Dialogue: 2,1:23:26.66,1:23:28.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Gray!
Dialogue: 2,1:23:28.24,1:23:31.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my God! Thank God! What happened? What is this?
Dialogue: 2,1:23:31.48,1:23:32.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:23:32.64,1:23:36.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Where did you go? Why didn't you come back?
Dialogue: 2,1:23:36.67,1:23:38.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- I was so worried about you. - Who's that?
Dialogue: 2,1:23:44.91,1:23:46.59,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We work together.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:47.60,1:23:48.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:48.48,1:23:52.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- We gotta go. - Okay. Come on. Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:54.51,1:23:57.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, hey! You guys can't just be walking up in...
Dialogue: 2,1:23:57.27,1:24:00.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Simon Masrani's death was a tragedy.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:01.41,1:24:05.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The new mission is to prevent further loss of life.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:05.17,1:24:06.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Who are these guys?
Dialogue: 2,1:24:06.71,1:24:08.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad you asked.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:08.66,1:24:11.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're all relieved of duty.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:11.03,1:24:13.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,There's a new team on the ground.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:32.31,1:24:34.23,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Lowery, I'm on my way back to you.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:34.23,1:24:35.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's a bad idea.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:35.36,1:24:36.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The board assigned emergency
Dialogue: 2,1:24:36.88,1:24:39.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,ops to INGEN's private security division.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:39.11,1:24:40.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This guy Hoskins is in charge.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:40.85,1:24:42.26,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And he has this insane
Dialogue: 2,1:24:42.26,1:24:45.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,plan to use the Raptors to hunt the Indominus.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:45.20,1:24:47.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean "Use the Raptors"?
Dialogue: 2,1:24:47.17,1:24:49.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 2,1:24:50.43,1:24:51.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You shouldn't say "Bitch."
Dialogue: 2,1:24:51.80,1:24:55.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Take the kids. Get them someplace safe.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:11.20,1:25:14.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- You got this! Damn it, drive! - Go faster!
Dialogue: 2,1:25:20.62,1:25:22.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This does not feel safe.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:22.50,1:25:23.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Can we stay with you?
Dialogue: 2,1:25:23.50,1:25:26.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I am never leaving you as long as you live.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:26.52,1:25:27.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, no, no. Him.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:29.45,1:25:31.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, definitely him.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:58.33,1:26:00.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Right here.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:01.40,1:26:03.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Right here.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:03.48,1:26:04.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,She looks at what she wants.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:04.84,1:26:09.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Usually what she wants to eat.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:27.81,1:26:30.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The mother hen has finally arrived.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:31.96,1:26:37.16,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get the hell out of here and stay away from my animals.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:37.38,1:26:41.26,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hoskins, you wanted this to happen, you son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 2,1:26:41.26,1:26:42.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Jesus!
Dialogue: 2,1:26:42.13,1:26:44.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How many more people have to die
Dialogue: 2,1:26:44.01,1:26:46.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,before this mission starts to make sense to you?
Dialogue: 2,1:26:46.84,1:26:48.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not a mission.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:48.15,1:26:49.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a field test.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:49.48,1:26:52.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is an INGEN situation now.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:52.79,1:26:54.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, there are gonna be
Dialogue: 2,1:26:54.15,1:26:56.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,cruise ships that show up here at first light.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:56.76,1:26:58.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Everybody's gonna get off this island.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:58.55,1:26:59.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're gonna watch a news
Dialogue: 2,1:26:59.99,1:27:02.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,story tomorrow about how you all saved lives.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:02.57,1:27:03.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, no, no, better yet...
Dialogue: 2,1:27:03.82,1:27:06.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,how your animals saved lives.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:08.63,1:27:11.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They've never been out of containment. It's crazy.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:11.58,1:27:13.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's move it out!
Dialogue: 2,1:27:14.36,1:27:15.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is happening!
Dialogue: 2,1:27:15.82,1:27:19.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,With or without you.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:22.84,1:27:25.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We know that she is in sector five.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:25.20,1:27:28.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is a game we call hide-and-seek. It's a scent drill.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:28.19,1:27:30.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We've done it about a thousand times with these animals.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:30.38,1:27:34.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,When they get on target, and they will get on target...
Dialogue: 2,1:27:34.19,1:27:36.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,wait to engage.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:36.05,1:27:39.23,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Velociraptors are pack hunters.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:39.23,1:27:41.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They like to herd the animal into a kill zone.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:41.74,1:27:43.28,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's when we take our shot.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:43.28,1:27:44.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get a clear shot, wait on
Dialogue: 2,1:27:44.62,1:27:46.92,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,my command and give her everything you got.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:46.92,1:27:49.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We got one good target, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:49.09,1:27:51.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Do not shoot my Raptors.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:51.99,1:27:53.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Please.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:54.10,1:27:55.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Easy, Blue.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:55.96,1:27:58.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Easy.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:59.78,1:28:01.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Attagirl.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:03.65,1:28:05.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't scare me.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:05.46,1:28:06.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Owen.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:11.57,1:28:12.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Are they safe?
Dialogue: 2,1:28:13.75,1:28:15.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, they're not.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:15.98,1:28:17.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What are their names?
Dialogue: 2,1:28:17.58,1:28:20.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you got Charlie.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:20.20,1:28:22.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,There's Echo. Here is Delta.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:22.97,1:28:26.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This one's called Blue. She's the beta.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:26.62,1:28:28.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Who's the alpha?
Dialogue: 2,1:28:28.15,1:28:30.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're looking at him, kid.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:35.17,1:28:36.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,See?
Dialogue: 2,1:28:36.04,1:28:37.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Totally safe.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:38.97,1:28:41.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, get in. Come on.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:41.04,1:28:42.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get in there.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:45.00,1:28:48.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,If you need me, I'll be right up front.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:48.09,1:28:49.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Just open that window.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:49.81,1:28:51.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:28:52.09,1:28:53.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Put your seatbelts on.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:57.17,1:28:58.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, so just...
Dialogue: 2,1:28:58.97,1:29:01.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,hold hands.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:21.38,1:29:23.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing's getting in here, right?
Dialogue: 2,1:29:26.51,1:29:27.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:29.81,1:29:32.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you remember that ghost at the old house?
Dialogue: 2,1:29:32.63,1:29:34.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Remember the one in the garage?
Dialogue: 2,1:29:35.91,1:29:37.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I protected you, right?
Dialogue: 2,1:29:39.87,1:29:43.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You made a battle axe out of a ruler and a paper plate.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:43.81,1:29:48.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. See, nothing is gonna get you while I'm around, okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:29:49.21,1:29:51.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,But you're not always gonna be around.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:52.47,1:29:54.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, well...
Dialogue: 2,1:29:54.91,1:29:56.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:56.04,1:29:59.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We're brothers, okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:29:59.62,1:30:00.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll always be brothers
Dialogue: 2,1:30:00.81,1:30:02.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and we'll always come back to one another.
Dialogue: 2,1:30:05.60,1:30:07.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 2,1:30:08.16,1:30:09.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No matter what?
Dialogue: 2,1:30:09.55,1:30:11.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 2,1:30:33.51,1:30:34.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Awesome.
Dialogue: 2,1:30:47.91,1:30:48.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 2,1:32:00.84,1:32:02.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Your boyfriend's a badass.
Dialogue: 2,1:32:15.84,1:32:18.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Imagine if we had these puppies in Tora Bora.
Dialogue: 2,1:32:21.20,1:32:23.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you recording this thing?
Dialogue: 2,1:32:35.43,1:32:36.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're slowing down.
Dialogue: 2,1:32:37.79,1:32:39.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They got something.
Dialogue: 2,1:32:57.73,1:33:00.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You know what? No, no, no. You guys are not gonna watch this.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:00.56,1:33:01.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Keep the window closed.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:37.96,1:33:39.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:40.65,1:33:42.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're communicating.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:49.12,1:33:52.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I know why they wouldn't tell us what it's made of.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:52.43,1:33:53.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 2,1:33:58.06,1:34:00.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That thing's part Raptor.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:07.99,1:34:10.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What's taking them so long? Light it up!
Dialogue: 2,1:34:10.54,1:34:11.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Engage!
Dialogue: 2,1:34:26.18,1:34:27.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:39.07,1:34:40.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Watch your six.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:40.55,1:34:43.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Raptors got a new alpha.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:05.07,1:36:06.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,To the vehicles now!
Dialogue: 2,1:36:06.58,1:36:08.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Fall back!
Dialogue: 2,1:36:30.59,1:36:31.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 2,1:36:31.35,1:36:32.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Blue!
Dialogue: 2,1:36:46.45,1:36:47.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:47.83,1:36:50.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Is everybody dead?
Dialogue: 2,1:36:50.01,1:36:52.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, no, no. Everyone is fine.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:52.88,1:36:53.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't lie to him.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:53.90,1:36:56.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He's scared. It's okay to lie when people are scared.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:56.66,1:36:58.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanna go home.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:58.06,1:37:00.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sweetheart, you will, okay? I promise.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:00.24,1:37:01.93,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Tomorrow you will be home...
Dialogue: 2,1:37:01.93,1:37:05.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and your mother will never let me see you again.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:06.25,1:37:07.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get out of here! Go!
Dialogue: 2,1:37:12.45,1:37:13.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're coming!
Dialogue: 2,1:37:23.98,1:37:26.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Just hold on back there.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:15.43,1:38:17.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Turn it on. - I don't know how.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:30.14,1:38:31.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you boys okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:38:31.27,1:38:33.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, did you see that?
Dialogue: 2,1:38:33.64,1:38:35.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't wait to tell Mom.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:35.76,1:38:39.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Please, no. Do not tell your mother about that, ever.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:42.02,1:38:43.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Owen! - Owen!
Dialogue: 2,1:38:48.36,1:38:50.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We gotta get indoors. Follow me.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:56.16,1:38:59.34,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Lowery, we're headed your way. Call in a chopper.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:12.70,1:39:14.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Everything must be accounted for.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:15.60,1:39:17.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I want all backup generators online.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:23.59,1:39:24.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Where have you been?
Dialogue: 2,1:39:24.95,1:39:28.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Change of plans. Mission took a jog to the left.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:28.32,1:39:29.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm taking everything off-site.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:29.82,1:39:31.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The embryos are safe here.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:31.42,1:39:33.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They can live up to eight weeks on the generators.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:33.73,1:39:37.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, no. You listen. The park's gonna be Chapter 11 by morning.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:37.51,1:39:40.26,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, our little side project's about to get a shot in the arm.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:40.26,1:39:41.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want a bunch of lawyers messing around
Dialogue: 2,1:39:41.72,1:39:43.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,with something that they don't understand.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:43.06,1:39:45.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You get it?
Dialogue: 2,1:39:45.18,1:39:48.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! I'm gonna take that as a yes.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:50.66,1:39:54.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Ladies and gentlemen, we'd like to thank you for your patience.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:54.52,1:39:58.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The next ferry will be leaving in 45 minutes.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:58.55,1:40:01.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,If you require immediate medical attention, please
Dialogue: 2,1:40:01.07,1:40:03.34,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,report to the nearest health service station.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:03.34,1:40:05.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Is this what you had in mind?
Dialogue: 2,1:40:05.07,1:40:07.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, people. We have an extraction point at the east dock.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:11.52,1:40:12.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:12.25,1:40:14.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They said we had to evacuate. There's a boat.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:14.40,1:40:15.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You coming?
Dialogue: 2,1:40:23.96,1:40:25.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Someone has to stay behind.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:30.74,1:40:33.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No. I have a boyfriend.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:33.77,1:40:37.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't know that you guys were, like, together-together.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:37.13,1:40:38.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We are.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:38.33,1:40:40.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's good. You don't mention him, ever.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:40.79,1:40:41.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'm at work.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:41.90,1:40:43.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, no, no. Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:43.47,1:40:46.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Well... - Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:46.63,1:40:47.61,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Great. - Great.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:47.61,1:40:48.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Okay. - Okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:48.58,1:40:50.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Are you gonna be okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:50.09,1:40:52.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, bye.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:00.91,1:41:02.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Where's Hoskins?
Dialogue: 2,1:41:02.53,1:41:05.41,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He's sending you and the assets to a secure location.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:05.41,1:41:07.34,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,But our deal is still intact?
Dialogue: 2,1:41:07.34,1:41:10.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry. You'll be well taken care of. Let's go!
Dialogue: 2,1:41:16.91,1:41:19.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for visiting Jurassic World.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:19.66,1:41:21.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We hope you enjoyed your adventure.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:21.76,1:41:24.68,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't forget to visit the gift shop, and remember...
Dialogue: 2,1:41:24.68,1:41:28.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's always happy hour at Margaritaville.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:31.36,1:41:33.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, come on. Go inside.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:41.21,1:41:43.28,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Control room. That way.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:53.79,1:41:55.61,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They evacuated the lab.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:36.41,1:42:37.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 2,1:42:37.60,1:42:40.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm afraid that's above your pay grade, honey.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:41.78,1:42:43.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Where's Henry?
Dialogue: 2,1:42:44.33,1:42:46.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Dr. Wu works for us.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:47.14,1:42:49.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not a real dinosaur.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:50.05,1:42:51.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, it ain't, kid.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:53.44,1:42:57.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,But somebody's gotta make sure that this company has a future.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:57.19,1:42:59.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Imagine...
Dialogue: 2,1:42:59.08,1:43:03.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,that one, a fraction of the size...
Dialogue: 2,1:43:03.51,1:43:04.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,deadly...
Dialogue: 2,1:43:04.05,1:43:05.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,intelligent...
Dialogue: 2,1:43:05.44,1:43:09.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,able to hide from the most advanced military technology.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:09.76,1:43:13.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,A living weapon unlike anything we've ever seen.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:13.10,1:43:18.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You see? Millions of years of evolution... what did we learn?
Dialogue: 2,1:43:20.67,1:43:23.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Nature is the gift that just...
Dialogue: 2,1:43:23.21,1:43:24.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 2,1:43:27.34,1:43:28.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Easy.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:29.96,1:43:31.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Easy, boy.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:31.33,1:43:34.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Easy. Hey, hey.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:36.76,1:43:39.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We're on the same side, right? Right?
Dialogue: 2,1:43:41.96,1:43:43.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Easy.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:44.17,1:43:45.77,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Easy.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:45.77,1:43:48.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm on your side.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:56.80,1:43:59.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, boys. This way. Come on.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:59.11,1:44:00.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:36.02,1:44:37.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's how it is, huh?
Dialogue: 2,1:44:54.51,1:44:56.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Easy.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:00.39,1:45:01.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Easy.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:10.87,1:45:13.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's it.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:22.14,1:46:24.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,24, 50.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:25.33,1:46:26.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We need more.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:28.05,1:46:28.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,More what?
Dialogue: 2,1:46:28.96,1:46:32.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Teeth. We need more teeth.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:41.66,1:46:44.28,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, so, you just wait here.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:45.54,1:46:47.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 2,1:47:35.53,1:47:37.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Lowery, are you still there?
Dialogue: 2,1:47:37.55,1:47:39.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, where are you?
Dialogue: 2,1:47:39.00,1:47:41.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I need you to open Paddock 9.
Dialogue: 2,1:47:41.80,1:47:43.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Paddock 9?
Dialogue: 2,1:47:44.65,1:47:45.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You kidding?
Dialogue: 2,1:47:50.62,1:47:53.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it, Lowery, be a man and do something for once in your life.
Dialogue: 2,1:47:53.99,1:47:56.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you have to make it personal?
Dialogue: 2,1:50:10.80,1:50:12.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Run!
Dialogue: 2,1:50:12.76,1:50:14.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Go! Go, go!
Dialogue: 2,1:53:42.82,1:53:45.26,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my God, it's your parents. It's your parents.
Dialogue: 2,1:53:46.40,1:53:48.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 2,1:53:51.60,1:53:57.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay? Oh, baby.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:04.14,1:54:05.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:07.37,1:54:09.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:54:13.44,1:54:14.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come here.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:16.62,1:54:18.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sweetie.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:35.38,1:54:37.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,So, what do we do now?
Dialogue: 2,1:54:38.23,1:54:40.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Probably stick together.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:42.45,1:54:44.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,For survival.
